1
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:09,384
[crow cawing]

2
00:00:09,468 --> 00:00:10,469
[Pani Bottle]
I wonder what card she'll play.

3
00:00:11,053 --> 00:00:12,930
If she doesn't want to end it now,
she'll use it later.

4
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:15,599
Ah, maybe Jimin should've played it safe.

5
00:00:15,682 --> 00:00:16,808
-But...
-Am I wrong?

6
00:00:16,892 --> 00:00:18,644
...Jimin could boldly use
the Joker to win.

7
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:20,938
-Yeah.
-[Pani Bottle] If Horseking decides

8
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:23,982
to absolutely not play any card
other than the King...

9
00:00:24,066 --> 00:00:25,776
-Yeah.
-...she can be aggressive.

10
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:27,402
What? I keep getting messages.

11
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:30,405
[♪ intriguing music playing]

12
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:35,869
[dealer] We will announce the results.

13
00:00:43,335 --> 00:00:45,003
PARK JIMIN, HORSEKING

14
00:00:45,087 --> 00:00:46,547
We will check the cards.

15
00:00:51,134 --> 00:00:53,929
The winner is Horseking.

16
00:00:57,182 --> 00:00:58,183
[Jimin groans]

17
00:01:00,310 --> 00:01:03,563
[Horseking] I don't know
if my opponent has Joker,

18
00:01:03,647 --> 00:01:07,317
but even if they do,
they'd never play it first.

19
00:01:08,151 --> 00:01:09,236
That's the battle of wits.

20
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:12,573
Even if she has a Joker,
how could she possibly play it?

21
00:01:12,656 --> 00:01:14,700
I thought it was the perfect move.

22
00:01:15,951 --> 00:01:16,952
[exhales]

23
00:01:17,661 --> 00:01:21,039
If I put down the Joker
and it gets taken, I'm done.

24
00:01:21,123 --> 00:01:25,002
The pressure mounted, and I was going
to throw it away anyway,

25
00:01:25,085 --> 00:01:26,128
so I decided to play the 4.

26
00:01:26,712 --> 00:01:29,172
Geez, it was Horseking again.

27
00:01:29,256 --> 00:01:32,593
I really want to send him home.
[sighs frustratedly]

28
00:01:38,849 --> 00:01:40,183
PARK JIMIN

29
00:01:40,267 --> 00:01:42,811
"I lost. Horseking must've played his 7.
I played my 4."

30
00:01:43,603 --> 00:01:44,604
Why?

31
00:01:44,688 --> 00:01:45,772
Did she play her 4?

32
00:01:46,315 --> 00:01:47,441
They announced it?

33
00:01:48,442 --> 00:01:49,568
[Pani Bottle] Then, the 4 is gone.

34
00:01:50,068 --> 00:01:51,069
[clears throat]

35
00:01:51,903 --> 00:01:54,698
[sighs] Playing the Joker was too risky.

36
00:01:56,575 --> 00:01:59,369
-You played your 4, right?
-I did. He must've used his 7.

37
00:01:59,453 --> 00:02:01,705
It's because he can't play
the King so easily.

38
00:02:02,539 --> 00:02:03,915
He knows I might have the Joker.

39
00:02:04,916 --> 00:02:05,917
[sighs]

40
00:02:06,793 --> 00:02:09,129
When I heard she didn't play the Joker,
I was disappointed,

41
00:02:09,212 --> 00:02:11,340
but I don't think
I could've played it either.

42
00:02:11,423 --> 00:02:15,052
I think her thought was,
"Would he play the King right away

43
00:02:15,135 --> 00:02:16,637
without knowing who has the Joker?"

44
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:20,015
At this point,
we really need to be running around.

45
00:02:20,098 --> 00:02:22,142
The question is, who has the Joker?

46
00:02:22,225 --> 00:02:23,352
-[Jaegyun] Yeah.
-[ZZONE] Right.

47
00:02:23,435 --> 00:02:25,687
DDOLDDOL, JUNSEO, EUNSIL
JIMIN, PANI BOTTLE

48
00:02:25,771 --> 00:02:28,398
You should keep an eye on Jimin.

49
00:02:28,482 --> 00:02:30,275
-Me? I can just tag her?
-[Horseking] Yeah.

50
00:02:30,359 --> 00:02:34,029
It's because I kind of have a feeling
that Jimin has the Joker.

51
00:02:34,112 --> 00:02:36,198
[♪ thrilling music playing]

52
00:02:37,824 --> 00:02:40,243
She knew I had the King
and played mind games with me.

53
00:02:40,327 --> 00:02:42,371
He wouldn't play the King, right?

54
00:02:42,454 --> 00:02:44,289
She said that.
Of course, it could've been a bluff.

55
00:02:44,373 --> 00:02:45,916
But in any case, I took that as,

56
00:02:45,999 --> 00:02:49,044
"I may have the Joker.
You sure you want to come at me?"

57
00:02:49,127 --> 00:02:51,880
So it's likely Jimin has it.
Let's tag and beat her.

58
00:02:51,963 --> 00:02:54,132
If she's not eliminated,
she's definitely the Joker.

59
00:02:54,216 --> 00:02:56,134
-Right.
-Jimin's easy to tag. Let's start there.

60
00:02:56,218 --> 00:02:57,469
-Then...
-[Jaegyun] Junseo.

61
00:02:57,552 --> 00:03:00,597
Junseo's the only one with two cards.
Everyone else is clinging to one.

62
00:03:00,681 --> 00:03:02,849
-That's why Junseo is protecting them.
-[ZZONE] Yeah.

63
00:03:02,933 --> 00:03:05,018
[Horseking] We need to think
of getting rid of Junseo too.

64
00:03:05,102 --> 00:03:06,937
BIGGEST THREAT TO BLUE TEAM IS JUNSEO

65
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:10,232
At this point,
you need to go after Junseo.

66
00:03:10,315 --> 00:03:11,400
Nothing else matters.

67
00:03:11,483 --> 00:03:14,569
You have an 8.
It's definitely higher than Junseo's card.

68
00:03:14,653 --> 00:03:16,238
You need to play the 8.

69
00:03:16,321 --> 00:03:19,741
[Dail] I had the highest card
after Horseking.

70
00:03:19,825 --> 00:03:22,619
My assignment for our team

71
00:03:22,703 --> 00:03:25,831
was to tag Yuk Junseo with my 8.

72
00:03:25,914 --> 00:03:28,125
[Jaegyun] Dail, the best move
is to have you tag Junseo.

73
00:03:28,208 --> 00:03:29,209
DAIL'S TARGET IS JUNSEO

74
00:03:29,292 --> 00:03:31,336
Let's eliminate them one at a time now.

75
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:33,004
[alarm blaring]

76
00:03:33,088 --> 00:03:34,381
I'll go to the reeds.

77
00:03:35,048 --> 00:03:36,049
[Dail] Go to the right.

78
00:03:36,133 --> 00:03:38,593
-[host] The Battle Round has begun.
-[Dail] Let's go.

79
00:03:38,677 --> 00:03:40,679
[♪ thrilling music continues playing]

80
00:03:53,692 --> 00:03:54,693
[Horseking] What?

81
00:03:56,695 --> 00:03:57,821
[♪ music fades]

82
00:03:57,904 --> 00:04:00,657
RED TEAM BASE, 2ND FLOOR

83
00:04:01,283 --> 00:04:03,285
[♪ mysterious music playing]

84
00:04:09,082 --> 00:04:11,626
RED TEAM IS HIDING

85
00:04:11,710 --> 00:04:13,128
10 MINUTES AGO

86
00:04:13,628 --> 00:04:15,922
I don't think we can look
for symbols right now.

87
00:04:16,506 --> 00:04:17,841
We've only found one so far.

88
00:04:17,924 --> 00:04:19,509
We should lie in wait here.

89
00:04:19,593 --> 00:04:22,387
-We should just ambush them.
-Guerrilla warfare?

90
00:04:22,471 --> 00:04:25,056
-We should stay here.
-Watch and guard them?

91
00:04:26,641 --> 00:04:28,935
[Horseking] No one's coming out!
I think we can search around!

92
00:04:29,019 --> 00:04:30,312
No one's coming out!

93
00:04:30,395 --> 00:04:31,396
Same here!

94
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:35,358
[ZZONE] This is actually
a great opportunity.

95
00:04:36,401 --> 00:04:37,903
[Joonsu] We should look for the symbols.

96
00:04:40,030 --> 00:04:41,323
Where are they?

97
00:04:44,242 --> 00:04:45,243
[Jaegyun] There's nothing.

98
00:04:45,327 --> 00:04:47,370
This is driving me crazy.

99
00:04:51,416 --> 00:04:52,417
[ZZONE] What?

100
00:04:55,086 --> 00:04:56,087
Red.

101
00:04:59,007 --> 00:05:02,093
Don't tag me. Don't tag me.

102
00:05:02,177 --> 00:05:04,721
Please. [panting]

103
00:05:05,472 --> 00:05:07,057
ZZONE found one!

104
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:09,267
[Jaegyun] Did you find it?
Bring it over carefully.

105
00:05:09,351 --> 00:05:11,353
[Horseking] That's our third one.
Okay, go!

106
00:05:12,687 --> 00:05:13,730
No one's coming out!

107
00:05:13,814 --> 00:05:14,856
[Dail] Same here!

108
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,608
[exclaims]

109
00:05:18,693 --> 00:05:22,197
BLUE TEAM DESTROYS THIRD SYMBOL

110
00:05:24,783 --> 00:05:25,992
[♪ intriguing music playing]

111
00:05:26,076 --> 00:05:27,744
[Junseo whispering]
They're coming close from there.

112
00:05:30,831 --> 00:05:31,832
JOONSU APPROACHES RED TEAM BASE

113
00:05:31,915 --> 00:05:33,375
[Jimin] I think we can beat Joonsu.

114
00:05:34,084 --> 00:05:36,920
-Let's go over there.
-[Junseo] Want to go around back?

115
00:05:52,269 --> 00:05:53,728
[♪ tense music playing]

116
00:05:53,812 --> 00:05:55,105
[footsteps]

117
00:05:55,188 --> 00:05:56,273
[Jimin] Hey, hide.

118
00:05:57,232 --> 00:05:58,233
Follow me.

119
00:05:59,359 --> 00:06:01,444
They're hiding here!

120
00:06:01,528 --> 00:06:03,238
[Jimin] I think I can get Joonsu.

121
00:06:04,614 --> 00:06:06,825
-[Joonsu] Jimin and Junseo. Two!
-[Jimin] Let's get him.

122
00:06:06,908 --> 00:06:08,660
Let's get him. Shit.

123
00:06:08,743 --> 00:06:10,078
-Oh, no.
-Run, run.

124
00:06:11,621 --> 00:06:12,706
[ZZONE] Run, run!

125
00:06:13,456 --> 00:06:14,499
[Dail] Who is it?

126
00:06:14,583 --> 00:06:15,584
Junseo.

127
00:06:16,126 --> 00:06:17,752
-[Dail] Yuk Junseo?
-Yes.

128
00:06:19,254 --> 00:06:20,797
Tag Joonsu, and you win.

129
00:06:20,881 --> 00:06:22,173
-Of course.
-[Joonsu] There are two!

130
00:06:22,257 --> 00:06:23,258
YUK JUNSEO TARGETS JOONSU

131
00:06:23,341 --> 00:06:24,342
There are two here!

132
00:06:26,136 --> 00:06:29,639
Junseo was walking toward me,
so I thought, "Good, he came on his own."

133
00:06:30,223 --> 00:06:31,892
I had to tag Junseo.

134
00:06:32,767 --> 00:06:35,020
[Jimin] Quick, go get him. Go and tag him.

135
00:06:35,103 --> 00:06:36,104
DAIL TARGETS JUNSEO

136
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,899
You'll beat Joonsu for sure.

137
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:41,693
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

138
00:06:44,946 --> 00:06:47,073
[ZZONE] Tag, tag!

139
00:06:47,157 --> 00:06:48,783
ZZONE TAGS JUNSEO

140
00:06:49,451 --> 00:06:51,620
-[Junseo] Are you okay?
-[host] Tag confirmed.

141
00:06:52,537 --> 00:06:54,664
-[Dail] I was supposed to tag him.
-What?

142
00:06:54,748 --> 00:06:56,583
[♪ comical music plays]

143
00:06:56,666 --> 00:06:58,793
[exhales] How could she
possibly forget that?

144
00:06:58,877 --> 00:07:00,837
We talked about it
over 10 times in the meeting.

145
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:03,006
Horseking basically drilled that into us.

146
00:07:03,089 --> 00:07:05,467
You need to go after Junseo.
You need to play the 8.

147
00:07:05,550 --> 00:07:07,844
Dail, the best move
is to have you tag Junseo.

148
00:07:08,511 --> 00:07:10,388
[Dail] It was something we all knew.

149
00:07:10,472 --> 00:07:11,848
That was my mission.

150
00:07:11,931 --> 00:07:12,932
But then suddenly,

151
00:07:13,016 --> 00:07:16,102
ZZONE bumped into Junseo
as he was coming toward me.

152
00:07:16,186 --> 00:07:18,271
She was screaming
as she cut in from the side.

153
00:07:18,772 --> 00:07:21,441
I still don't get it.

154
00:07:22,150 --> 00:07:23,401
[Jimin panting]

155
00:07:23,485 --> 00:07:26,446
[Jimin] There's something odd about her.
She got told off by Dail.

156
00:07:26,529 --> 00:07:29,324
-[Ddolddol] Why?
-She wasn't supposed to tag Junseo.

157
00:07:31,701 --> 00:07:34,579
[dealer] Both players,
please hand in your cards.

158
00:07:36,331 --> 00:07:37,332
Here you go.

159
00:07:38,917 --> 00:07:45,382
ZZONE, YUK JUNSEO

160
00:07:45,465 --> 00:07:48,176
[dealer] Yuk Junseo has won.

161
00:07:48,259 --> 00:07:50,387
ZZONE'S 3 GOES TO JUNSEO

162
00:07:52,097 --> 00:07:53,515
[ZZONE] I was really bummed.

163
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,851
What just happened?

164
00:07:56,935 --> 00:07:58,353
That was out of nowhere.

165
00:07:58,436 --> 00:08:00,105
[Dail] Why would ZZONE tag him?

166
00:08:00,188 --> 00:08:03,358
He was already coming right toward me.

167
00:08:03,858 --> 00:08:06,403
To be fair, we knew Junseo had a 7.

168
00:08:06,486 --> 00:08:08,238
We did. We knew.

169
00:08:08,321 --> 00:08:10,281
[Horseking] We had a plan,
so why would she tag him?

170
00:08:10,365 --> 00:08:11,491
THEY COULD HAVE WON WITH DAIL'S 8

171
00:08:13,243 --> 00:08:15,412
Well, she's on our team,
so we have to trust her.

172
00:08:15,495 --> 00:08:16,496
For now,

173
00:08:17,247 --> 00:08:20,458
it's not bad because if Junseo used his 7
and we played something lower,

174
00:08:20,542 --> 00:08:22,919
we lose and Junseo takes the 3.

175
00:08:23,503 --> 00:08:25,380
But we could've finished it just now.

176
00:08:25,463 --> 00:08:26,756
[Jaegyun] It's okay, it's okay.

177
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,508
We can't help that now.

178
00:08:28,591 --> 00:08:30,301
-We're winning.
-[Jaegyun] That's right.

179
00:08:30,385 --> 00:08:32,846
I'm not blaming her or anything.
It was just weird.

180
00:08:32,929 --> 00:08:34,806
-Let's think about that later.
-[Jaegyun] Exactly.

181
00:08:34,889 --> 00:08:37,392
-Anyway, we need to win this game.
-[Horseking] Right.

182
00:08:37,475 --> 00:08:39,227
[Dail] I just really didn't get it.

183
00:08:39,310 --> 00:08:40,311
She has to be the Seeker.

184
00:08:40,395 --> 00:08:43,189
It doesn't make sense
unless she's the Seeker.

185
00:08:43,815 --> 00:08:45,358
What happened? Did you give it up?

186
00:08:45,442 --> 00:08:47,110
-[ZZONE] I lost.
-[Dail] You lost?

187
00:08:47,193 --> 00:08:51,114
I thought if I ran into him,
he wouldn't be able to stop me.

188
00:08:51,197 --> 00:08:52,615
-What?
-I thought if I ran into him,

189
00:08:52,699 --> 00:08:54,617
he wouldn't be able to stop me.

190
00:08:54,701 --> 00:08:56,453
We're asking why you tagged him.

191
00:08:56,536 --> 00:08:58,580
That was my mistake. [chuckles]

192
00:08:59,247 --> 00:09:00,582
I'm sorry.

193
00:09:00,665 --> 00:09:01,833
It's okay. It happens.

194
00:09:01,916 --> 00:09:04,586
It happens.
We lowered Junseo's card at least.

195
00:09:05,462 --> 00:09:07,797
That wasn't our main strategy.

196
00:09:07,881 --> 00:09:10,300
I apologize. I'm sorry. [chuckles]

197
00:09:11,593 --> 00:09:14,387
-Now, we have two possible scenarios.
-[Jaegyun exclaims]

198
00:09:14,471 --> 00:09:16,306
[Horseking] He had the 7.

199
00:09:17,057 --> 00:09:19,100
Now, he has a 7 and 3.

200
00:09:20,018 --> 00:09:21,728
-[Dail] Or a 3 and something.
-[Horseking] Yeah.

201
00:09:23,146 --> 00:09:25,440
So, the best thing
is for Dail to tag Junseo.

202
00:09:25,523 --> 00:09:26,775
With your 8.

203
00:09:26,858 --> 00:09:28,693
Just like before, I should tag him.

204
00:09:29,486 --> 00:09:30,695
MEANWHILE, RED TEAM

205
00:09:30,779 --> 00:09:32,072
[Pani Bottle]
Are we supposed to keep hiding?

206
00:09:32,155 --> 00:09:34,657
[Ddolddol] They're looking for symbols
while we're hiding.

207
00:09:34,741 --> 00:09:38,536
-[Pani Bottle] I know.
-Or should we all charge in?

208
00:09:39,162 --> 00:09:40,455
Face them head-on?

209
00:09:40,538 --> 00:09:42,749
Let's give it a try.

210
00:09:42,832 --> 00:09:45,794
Even if we go aggressive,
they can never tag you.

211
00:09:45,877 --> 00:09:47,003
I'll give it a shot.

212
00:09:47,087 --> 00:09:50,256
-[alarm blaring]
-I'll just go for it. All or nothing.

213
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:53,384
[Jimin] You go first.
Ddolddol should lead the way.

214
00:09:53,468 --> 00:09:55,428
[♪ thrilling music playing]

215
00:09:57,180 --> 00:09:58,723
[Joonsu] They're coming out!

216
00:09:58,807 --> 00:09:59,808
[players laugh]

217
00:10:00,391 --> 00:10:03,436
Geez, he's so annoying.

218
00:10:03,520 --> 00:10:05,313
They're in front of the gate.

219
00:10:05,396 --> 00:10:08,441
[scoffs] I want to punch him.

220
00:10:08,525 --> 00:10:11,820
[Jimin] Joonsu was on lookout duty.

221
00:10:12,445 --> 00:10:13,863
One person! Pani Bottle!

222
00:10:13,947 --> 00:10:15,657
There are four here!
Jimin and Junseo. Two!

223
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:17,075
HUMAN MEGAPHONE REPORTS EACH ROUND

224
00:10:17,158 --> 00:10:20,453
He went, "Ddolddol, Jimin!"

225
00:10:20,537 --> 00:10:21,830
That little brat.

226
00:10:22,330 --> 00:10:23,706
[sighs frustratedly]

227
00:10:23,790 --> 00:10:27,335
If I tag him, I'd take one card,
so I decided to tag Joonsu.

228
00:10:27,418 --> 00:10:29,254
Ah, Joonsu!

229
00:10:29,337 --> 00:10:32,173
-[Joonsu] Yes?
-I'm sick of it. I'm just sick of that.

230
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:34,384
Can't I just tag you once?

231
00:10:34,467 --> 00:10:35,468
This is scary.

232
00:10:36,427 --> 00:10:37,554
[Jimin] You can tag me!

233
00:10:37,637 --> 00:10:40,974
[Joonsu exclaims]
This is scary! Horseking!

234
00:10:42,475 --> 00:10:44,144
This is bait. They're baiting us.

235
00:10:44,227 --> 00:10:45,395
Come out to the middle.

236
00:10:45,478 --> 00:10:46,521
PLAYER SUBSTITUTION

237
00:10:46,604 --> 00:10:49,107
-Come here and tag me.
-You go away. I'm doing this with Joonsu.

238
00:10:49,190 --> 00:10:52,777
So come to the center. How can you expect
to take Joonsu over there?

239
00:10:52,861 --> 00:10:54,779
-[Joonsu] Joonsu, Joonsu!
-Yes, Joonsu, Joonsu.

240
00:10:54,863 --> 00:10:58,158
Hey, I said back up. I'm by myself.

241
00:10:58,908 --> 00:11:01,452
We're not coming after you.
Why are you so worked up?

242
00:11:01,536 --> 00:11:04,622
Look, I'm here by myself,
so you should back up.

243
00:11:04,706 --> 00:11:06,916
It's not like we're trying to tag you.

244
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,293
We're just telling you.

245
00:11:08,376 --> 00:11:10,753
If you want to do something,
come to the middle.

246
00:11:12,130 --> 00:11:15,175
[Junseo] We couldn't just go ahead
and tag them.

247
00:11:15,258 --> 00:11:18,845
The Blue Team's King,
Horseking, was there.

248
00:11:18,928 --> 00:11:21,389
One wrong move,
and the King could take our card.

249
00:11:21,472 --> 00:11:23,099
We both knew who each other's Kings were.

250
00:11:23,183 --> 00:11:25,852
We knew Ddolddol
would try to come and tag us.

251
00:11:25,935 --> 00:11:28,855
We couldn't just rush in and tag them.

252
00:11:28,938 --> 00:11:29,939
THE TWO KINGS IN A STANDOFF

253
00:11:30,023 --> 00:11:32,317
That's why time slowly started to pass.

254
00:11:32,901 --> 00:11:34,402
[Jimin] Are we going to keep doing this?

255
00:11:35,445 --> 00:11:36,487
We're at an advantage.

256
00:11:36,571 --> 00:11:38,948
We have the upper hand.
We have no reason to go.

257
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:44,579
-I think there are four of them.
-There are four.

258
00:11:44,662 --> 00:11:46,539
-The other one is Yang Dail.
-[Ddolddol] Four, right?

259
00:11:46,623 --> 00:11:50,793
They keep telling me to come out,
so don't you think Dail is hiding?

260
00:11:50,877 --> 00:11:52,003
[Joonsu] Where's Dail?

261
00:11:52,086 --> 00:11:53,713
He went off by himself again.

262
00:12:04,390 --> 00:12:05,391
[Dail] No one's here.

263
00:12:10,438 --> 00:12:12,315
RED TEAM BASE

264
00:12:12,398 --> 00:12:15,735
If I go through the main entrance,
I'll definitely get caught.

265
00:12:15,818 --> 00:12:17,987
I was looking for another way in.

266
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:22,242
Then, I spotted this tiny opening
through the window.

267
00:12:25,912 --> 00:12:27,372
So I went right through it.

268
00:12:27,455 --> 00:12:30,875
SUCCESSFULLY INFILTRATES RED TEAM BASE

269
00:12:34,921 --> 00:12:36,381
[Jimin] Let me tag you once!

270
00:12:37,090 --> 00:12:38,466
PEEKING OUT

271
00:12:43,721 --> 00:12:46,349
Let me tag you once!
Let's do something at least!

272
00:12:46,432 --> 00:12:48,101
-This is ridiculous!
-[Joonsu] I can tag you?

273
00:12:48,685 --> 00:12:50,103
[Jimin] Let me tag you one time!

274
00:12:50,853 --> 00:12:54,148
[Pani Bottle] I wish we could go around
and do something while stalling.

275
00:13:02,949 --> 00:13:04,784
[Pani Bottle coughs, clears throat]

276
00:13:05,868 --> 00:13:07,870
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

277
00:13:31,394 --> 00:13:34,022
I played the 7,
so it should be lower than 7, right?

278
00:13:35,606 --> 00:13:38,026
I think Junseo has to go against Jaegyun.

279
00:13:38,109 --> 00:13:41,237
[Dail] I had to tag Yuk Junseo.
I'm going to make that happen.

280
00:13:48,411 --> 00:13:49,662
[Pani Bottle] There's no way around.

281
00:13:49,746 --> 00:13:50,872
Because the reeds are so...

282
00:13:50,955 --> 00:13:53,041
-All five of them are there?
-Yes.

283
00:13:53,124 --> 00:13:54,834
-All five of them?
-I'm not sure.

284
00:13:54,917 --> 00:13:56,252
Yang Dail's missing.

285
00:14:01,924 --> 00:14:04,927
[Dail] There were a lot of branches.

286
00:14:06,387 --> 00:14:09,432
If I dash out making some rustling noise,

287
00:14:09,515 --> 00:14:11,768
they'll have enough time to get away.

288
00:14:12,810 --> 00:14:14,937
I decided to go without my shoes.

289
00:14:29,744 --> 00:14:32,789
But Horseking... Right, he took the 7.

290
00:14:32,872 --> 00:14:34,582
How does Eunsil take the 7?

291
00:14:34,665 --> 00:14:35,833
If he won with the King,

292
00:14:35,917 --> 00:14:37,502
-we can't take the 7.
-Right.

293
00:14:40,922 --> 00:14:41,923
Jimin.

294
00:14:43,257 --> 00:14:44,258
What?

295
00:14:45,343 --> 00:14:46,969
[Joonsu] Should I just tag you?

296
00:14:48,262 --> 00:14:49,847
Should I just tag you?

297
00:14:53,226 --> 00:14:54,393
-[Dail] Tag.
-[grunts]

298
00:14:55,853 --> 00:14:57,271
-[Jimin] Hey!
-Oh, my gosh.

299
00:14:57,355 --> 00:14:59,065
[exclaims] What?

300
00:15:00,858 --> 00:15:01,859
[sighs frustratedly]

301
00:15:01,943 --> 00:15:03,236
-Are you okay?
-[alarm blaring]

302
00:15:03,319 --> 00:15:04,362
-Are you okay?
-I'm okay.

303
00:15:04,445 --> 00:15:05,863
[host] Tag confirmed.

304
00:15:05,947 --> 00:15:07,198
[Horseking] Did he do it?

305
00:15:07,281 --> 00:15:08,491
YANG DAIL TAGS YUK JUNSEO

306
00:15:08,574 --> 00:15:10,368
[ZZONE yells] That was awesome!

307
00:15:11,077 --> 00:15:12,995
-He was doing a heads-up play.
-Yeah.

308
00:15:13,079 --> 00:15:14,914
-That's why he was so quiet.
-[Horseking] He was.

309
00:15:14,997 --> 00:15:16,374
BLUE TEAM TAGS JUNSEO AS PLANNED

310
00:15:16,999 --> 00:15:18,126
[Dail] I was being stealthy.

311
00:15:18,209 --> 00:15:20,378
-I even took off my shoes...
-I see.

312
00:15:20,461 --> 00:15:22,463
-...to not make any noise.
-[chuckles]

313
00:15:23,214 --> 00:15:25,174
[Junseo] He even took his shoes off
and ran over.

314
00:15:25,258 --> 00:15:27,927
I guess that's why
I couldn't hear him coming.

315
00:15:28,010 --> 00:15:29,637
I was caught off guard.

316
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:32,348
I can't believe I got tagged.
It hurt my pride a bit.

317
00:15:36,602 --> 00:15:37,937
DAIL SUBMITS AN 8

318
00:15:42,441 --> 00:15:45,069
JUNSEO HANDS IN A CARD

319
00:15:45,570 --> 00:15:47,530
[dealer] We will announce the results.

320
00:15:48,030 --> 00:15:51,117
Yuk Junseo has won.

321
00:15:51,784 --> 00:15:53,786
[♪ intense music playing]

322
00:15:56,539 --> 00:15:59,375
[Dail exclaims]

323
00:16:01,252 --> 00:16:03,045
-There's no need to check ours.
-[Junseo] Right.

324
00:16:03,129 --> 00:16:05,089
For now, with the 8 and 9,

325
00:16:05,173 --> 00:16:07,425
you should play aggressively, Junseo.

326
00:16:07,508 --> 00:16:08,885
-Okay.
-Pretend to be the King.

327
00:16:08,968 --> 00:16:10,469
I'll take this first.

328
00:16:12,263 --> 00:16:15,141
If Yang Dail came running at me,

329
00:16:15,224 --> 00:16:18,269
I'd be sure that he had a high number.

330
00:16:18,978 --> 00:16:20,813
So I chose my 9

331
00:16:20,897 --> 00:16:22,899
and took Dail's 8.

332
00:16:22,982 --> 00:16:23,983
DAIL'S 8 GOES TO JUNSEO

333
00:16:24,609 --> 00:16:26,277
-Dail had an 8.
-Right.

334
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:28,821
You got that with your 9?
Nice. So damn nice.

335
00:16:28,905 --> 00:16:30,573
Yang Dail's a God damn chump now.

336
00:16:31,073 --> 00:16:33,326
[Junseo] I was thankful
that he came after me.

337
00:16:33,409 --> 00:16:36,078
It was amazing. I was cheering inside.

338
00:16:36,162 --> 00:16:37,455
Are you okay, Dail?

339
00:16:38,039 --> 00:16:39,040
No, I'm not.

340
00:16:39,123 --> 00:16:40,541
-[Jaegyun] Did you fall?
-[Horseking] He fell.

341
00:16:40,625 --> 00:16:41,918
-[Jaegyun] What?
-Really?

342
00:16:42,001 --> 00:16:43,002
[Joonsu] You fell?

343
00:16:44,045 --> 00:16:45,254
First of all, we lost.

344
00:16:49,383 --> 00:16:51,802
I told you Junseo seemed
to have an 8 and 9.

345
00:16:51,886 --> 00:16:52,887
It was an 8 and 9.

346
00:16:53,721 --> 00:16:55,056
[sighs heavily]

347
00:16:55,139 --> 00:16:56,891
I told you. He had an 8 and a 9,

348
00:16:56,974 --> 00:16:58,976
so he got you with his 8
and me with his 9.

349
00:16:59,060 --> 00:17:01,854
For them, that was pretty much
the best-case scenario.

350
00:17:01,938 --> 00:17:04,232
They took out a high card
with another high card.

351
00:17:04,315 --> 00:17:07,777
Whoa, something is seriously going wrong.

352
00:17:07,860 --> 00:17:11,948
Junseo has an 8 and 3.
Horseking can tag him when he sees him.

353
00:17:12,031 --> 00:17:13,449
Our 8 is gone.

354
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:15,868
[exclaims in annoyance]

355
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:19,121
[winces]

356
00:17:19,705 --> 00:17:21,499
[hisses, groans]

357
00:17:22,875 --> 00:17:24,001
[Dail] That hurts.

358
00:17:24,085 --> 00:17:25,294
[cries out]

359
00:17:25,378 --> 00:17:27,213
-[all exclaim]
-[Jaegyun] What happened?

360
00:17:27,296 --> 00:17:28,381
What is it?

361
00:17:28,464 --> 00:17:30,341
-Oh, no.
-[exclaims]

362
00:17:31,551 --> 00:17:33,970
YANG DAIL GOT INJURED AS WELL

363
00:17:34,053 --> 00:17:36,264
[♪ unsettling music playing]

364
00:17:36,347 --> 00:17:37,557
Was it because I ran barefoot?

365
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,724
-Barefoot?
-[Joonsu] You were barefoot?

366
00:17:38,808 --> 00:17:40,142
-Barefoot? With no socks?
-[Joonsu] Why?

367
00:17:40,226 --> 00:17:42,353
-Shoes would make noise.
-[Horseking] To not make noise?

368
00:17:42,895 --> 00:17:44,897
[Dail] I snuck in through the window.

369
00:17:46,232 --> 00:17:48,234
[ZZONE] I was a bit shaken for a moment.

370
00:17:50,403 --> 00:17:51,946
[Joonsu] He can't run anymore.

371
00:17:55,074 --> 00:17:56,242
We're in trouble.

372
00:17:58,703 --> 00:18:00,329
Could you get the medic, please?

373
00:18:00,413 --> 00:18:03,207
SAFETY PRECAUTIONS WERE TAKEN
AS THE CAST MEMBER RECEIVED

374
00:18:03,291 --> 00:18:05,167
PROPER FIRST AID AND CARE AFTER THE INJURY

375
00:18:06,669 --> 00:18:08,170
[Horseking] The sun's setting.

376
00:18:08,254 --> 00:18:09,672
8 HOURS HAVE PASSED

377
00:18:09,755 --> 00:18:11,507
[Pani Bottle] This could go on all night.

378
00:18:12,717 --> 00:18:15,428
THE SUN HAS SET NOW

379
00:18:15,511 --> 00:18:18,472
I hope they come here. If we look...

380
00:18:19,932 --> 00:18:22,518
I don't think they'll come here,
because they're scared.

381
00:18:22,602 --> 00:18:23,936
RED TEAM IS STILL PLANNING

382
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:25,563
They're too scared to come over here.

383
00:18:25,646 --> 00:18:28,399
But in their state of mind,
they might try to barge in.

384
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,943
[Junseo] Then, we should hide

385
00:18:31,027 --> 00:18:32,945
if they're going to come get us.

386
00:18:33,654 --> 00:18:35,823
-[Jimin] That's possible.
-Let's not go out.

387
00:18:35,906 --> 00:18:37,283
RED TEAM PLANS AN AMBUSH

388
00:18:37,366 --> 00:18:39,660
So the plan is to hide on the main road?

389
00:18:39,744 --> 00:18:41,871
-[Junseo] Yes.
-No, you shouldn't hide.

390
00:18:41,954 --> 00:18:43,456
You should stand in the front.

391
00:18:43,539 --> 00:18:45,708
I was a little mad at that point.

392
00:18:46,709 --> 00:18:50,713
Ddolddol was supposed to tag them
as much as possible.

393
00:18:51,339 --> 00:18:52,340
But he didn't.

394
00:18:52,423 --> 00:18:54,467
Whether he didn't want to or couldn't,

395
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:55,968
but he didn't. He couldn't do it.

396
00:18:58,262 --> 00:19:00,264
DIDN'T PROTECT THEM FROM BEING TAGGED

397
00:19:01,015 --> 00:19:02,016
[Jimin] Joonsu.

398
00:19:05,227 --> 00:19:08,898
[Eunsil] Ddolddol wasn't doing his job
as the King.

399
00:19:08,981 --> 00:19:10,149
DDOLDDOL RAN AWAY FIRST

400
00:19:10,232 --> 00:19:11,651
[sighs]

401
00:19:12,234 --> 00:19:15,029
-I think Ddolddol...
-[Ddolddol] And right now--

402
00:19:15,112 --> 00:19:17,448
...can go out a bit more.

403
00:19:17,531 --> 00:19:19,325
[Junseo] Horseking might barge in.

404
00:19:19,408 --> 00:19:21,786
[Jimin] Ddolddol
should be the one stopping him.

405
00:19:22,286 --> 00:19:24,747
[Eunsil] Do it, or change your name
to Kim Wuss-wuss.

406
00:19:24,830 --> 00:19:26,874
[players laugh]

407
00:19:26,957 --> 00:19:28,793
It's time for you to step up.

408
00:19:28,876 --> 00:19:32,129
MEANWHILE, BLUE TEAM

409
00:19:33,005 --> 00:19:34,840
[Dail] Hey, we have to win.

410
00:19:34,924 --> 00:19:36,926
-[Horseking] We'll win for you. Just wait.
-Yeah. Please.

411
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:40,721
If we end up losing like this,
I'll be really pissed off.

412
00:19:40,805 --> 00:19:43,641
We can win.
Right now, we know what Junseo has.

413
00:19:43,724 --> 00:19:45,393
-[Joonsu] Yes.
-An 8 and 3, right?

414
00:19:45,476 --> 00:19:46,477
An 8 and 3.

415
00:19:47,353 --> 00:19:49,313
And Ddolddol is...

416
00:19:49,397 --> 00:19:50,690
-King.
-[Dail] King.

417
00:19:50,773 --> 00:19:51,982
HORSEKING LEADS BLUE TEAM MEETING

418
00:19:52,066 --> 00:19:53,442
I don't think this is important.

419
00:19:53,526 --> 00:19:54,694
Anyway, that's that.

420
00:19:54,777 --> 00:19:56,696
-Who's next?
-Jimin, Pani Bottle, Eunsil.

421
00:19:56,779 --> 00:19:58,280
-[Horseking] Jimin and?
-Pani Bottle and Eunsil.

422
00:19:58,989 --> 00:20:02,201
Best case is if Junseo tags Joonsu,
and Joonsu plays a 4.

423
00:20:02,284 --> 00:20:04,620
-It doesn't matter if he plays an 8.
-[Jaegyun] The best case.

424
00:20:04,704 --> 00:20:06,288
-He'd never play that.
-The best-case scenario

425
00:20:06,372 --> 00:20:07,665
is Joonsu tagging Junseo.

426
00:20:07,748 --> 00:20:09,792
-[Joonsu] Right.
-[Dail] I think Joonsu...

427
00:20:10,543 --> 00:20:12,294
[Joonsu] Our plan at this point

428
00:20:12,378 --> 00:20:14,630
was to take everyone out except Ddolddol.

429
00:20:15,798 --> 00:20:20,177
Since I had the most cards,
I'd take away one of Junseo's cards.

430
00:20:21,053 --> 00:20:23,514
Then, the players with lower cards

431
00:20:23,597 --> 00:20:26,100
would tag the other team
and give them their low cards,

432
00:20:26,851 --> 00:20:28,436
while players with high cards

433
00:20:28,936 --> 00:20:31,272
would wipe out those
with the low cards they planted.

434
00:20:31,355 --> 00:20:35,192
We were going to make sure
we took them down with us.

435
00:20:35,276 --> 00:20:37,653
-[alarm blaring]
-[host] The Battle Round has begun.

436
00:20:37,737 --> 00:20:38,863
[ZZONE] Let's do this!

437
00:20:38,946 --> 00:20:39,989
[Horseking] Let's go!

438
00:20:40,072 --> 00:20:41,490
[Jaegyun and ZZONE] Let's go!

439
00:20:42,867 --> 00:20:44,326
[exhales] Let's do this.

440
00:20:45,911 --> 00:20:47,204
BLUE TEAM SPLITS UP AND CHARGES IN

441
00:20:47,288 --> 00:20:48,372
[Joonsu] First, Junseo.

442
00:20:48,456 --> 00:20:50,875
Yeah. Just go and get involved
with anyone, okay?

443
00:20:50,958 --> 00:20:52,168
JOONSU AND DAIL PLAN TO PASS LOW CARDS

444
00:20:52,251 --> 00:20:53,586
I should get tagged, right?

445
00:20:53,669 --> 00:20:54,712
-By Junseo?
-Yes.

446
00:20:55,296 --> 00:20:57,465
If Ddolddol is there, we have to retreat.

447
00:20:57,548 --> 00:20:58,674
Yeah, that's right.

448
00:21:01,135 --> 00:21:03,971
RED TEAM BASE

449
00:21:04,054 --> 00:21:05,681
-[Pani Bottle] They're not here?
-I think they'll go

450
00:21:05,765 --> 00:21:07,850
-around the back through the reeds.
-No, no.

451
00:21:07,933 --> 00:21:09,226
They're here.

452
00:21:09,310 --> 00:21:10,311
[Pani Bottle] They are?

453
00:21:12,313 --> 00:21:14,857
-[Joonsu] There are three here.
-[Horseking] Three here!

454
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:16,066
[Joonsu] Pani Bottle.

455
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:17,651
Who is it?

456
00:21:17,735 --> 00:21:20,404
I can only see Pani Bottle right now.
The short one.

457
00:21:21,447 --> 00:21:23,073
Ddolddol needs to be in front.

458
00:21:23,157 --> 00:21:25,034
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

459
00:21:25,534 --> 00:21:27,244
[Horseking] Is it three? Who are they?

460
00:21:27,328 --> 00:21:30,915
[Joonsu] Ddolddol, Jimin, and Junseo.

461
00:21:32,041 --> 00:21:33,209
[Jimin] Is that Joonsu?

462
00:21:33,292 --> 00:21:35,586
[Junseo] It's Joonsu.
Joonsu and Horseking.

463
00:21:36,879 --> 00:21:38,255
There are three here!

464
00:21:39,298 --> 00:21:41,425
-[Jimin] Joonsu and Horseking.
-[Ddolddol] Really?

465
00:21:41,509 --> 00:21:42,635
[Jimin] Joonsu and Horseking.

466
00:21:42,718 --> 00:21:47,139
RED TEAM STICKS TO THE PLAN
AND EVERYONE EXCEPT DDOLDDOL RUNS

467
00:21:51,018 --> 00:21:52,645
LOOKING AROUND

468
00:21:52,728 --> 00:21:54,063
[Horseking] My goodness.

469
00:21:54,146 --> 00:21:56,649
-You don't want to go back, do you?
-[Horseking] Yeah.

470
00:21:56,732 --> 00:21:58,734
[both laughing]

471
00:22:00,319 --> 00:22:01,904
[Ddolddol] If I catch you, you're dead.

472
00:22:01,987 --> 00:22:03,447
[Horseking] No, we won't die.

473
00:22:05,199 --> 00:22:07,660
[Joonsu] As long as it's not Ddolddol,

474
00:22:07,743 --> 00:22:09,745
it would be a gain, no matter who tags me.

475
00:22:09,829 --> 00:22:12,206
The best option was to tag Junseo.

476
00:22:12,289 --> 00:22:15,376
So, while Horseking
was distracting Ddolddol,

477
00:22:17,086 --> 00:22:19,088
I was focused on finding Junseo.

478
00:22:25,678 --> 00:22:26,762
[Jimin] Who's that?

479
00:22:26,846 --> 00:22:27,847
[Junseo] Joonsu.

480
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:37,481
[grunts]

481
00:22:37,565 --> 00:22:38,899
-[Joonsu] Are you okay?
-Tag!

482
00:22:38,983 --> 00:22:40,943
LEE JOONSU TAGS YUK JUNSEO

483
00:22:41,026 --> 00:22:42,528
[host] Tag confirmed.

484
00:22:42,611 --> 00:22:43,612
[Junseo sighs]

485
00:22:44,363 --> 00:22:47,032
TAGGED AS BLUE TEAM PLANNED

486
00:22:47,908 --> 00:22:51,036
[Joonsu] I tagged Junseo as we planned,
so we got the job done.

487
00:22:52,997 --> 00:22:53,998
[doorknob clicks]

488
00:22:58,878 --> 00:23:02,423
I didn't have to think.
I just put down a card as we planned.

489
00:23:02,506 --> 00:23:03,507
[Joonsu exhales]

490
00:23:04,842 --> 00:23:05,885
YUK JUNSEO'S CARDS

491
00:23:05,968 --> 00:23:07,136
[Junseo] I was very flustered.

492
00:23:07,219 --> 00:23:09,889
We didn't know
the other number card Joonsu had.

493
00:23:10,514 --> 00:23:14,977
THE CARD JOONSU SUBMITTED

494
00:23:15,060 --> 00:23:19,273
Maybe Joonsu's planning
to use his 2 as a sacrifice.

495
00:23:19,773 --> 00:23:22,610
Joonsu might dump his 2 here.

496
00:23:22,693 --> 00:23:24,820
-Right.
-Then, it's best to win with the 3.

497
00:23:24,904 --> 00:23:26,322
Joonsu tagged you

498
00:23:26,405 --> 00:23:28,282
-knowing that you have an 8.
-[Junseo] Yes.

499
00:23:28,365 --> 00:23:32,036
Then, it's a sacrifice.
That's a sacrifice play.

500
00:23:32,119 --> 00:23:33,537
RED TEAM EXPECTS JOONSU TO PLAY A 2

501
00:23:33,621 --> 00:23:37,791
YUK JUNSEO'S CARDS

502
00:23:40,753 --> 00:23:42,338
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

503
00:23:42,421 --> 00:23:44,506
LEE JOONSU, YUK JUNSEO

504
00:23:44,590 --> 00:23:45,716
[dealer] Lee Joonsu...

505
00:23:46,926 --> 00:23:48,260
has won.

506
00:23:48,802 --> 00:23:51,722
BLUE TEAM BRINGS JUNSEO
DOWN TO A SINGLE CARD

507
00:23:52,514 --> 00:23:55,851
Yeah! I beat Junseo.

508
00:23:55,935 --> 00:23:56,936
[chuckling]

509
00:23:58,604 --> 00:24:01,106
[cheering]

510
00:24:01,190 --> 00:24:02,524
Well done, well done.

511
00:24:03,233 --> 00:24:04,693
-It was a 3.
-[Horseking] What?

512
00:24:04,777 --> 00:24:05,778
The 3 card.

513
00:24:05,861 --> 00:24:07,446
-[Horseking] Nice! I knew it!
-[Jaegyun] Nice!

514
00:24:07,529 --> 00:24:11,617
[Horseking] Okay!
Then, the 3 card! Hold on.

515
00:24:11,700 --> 00:24:13,077
-You brought the 3?
-[Joonsu] Yes.

516
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:14,453
-[Jaegyun] He did. Good.
-[Joonsu] I did.

517
00:24:14,536 --> 00:24:16,914
-[Horseking] Crushed it. Just one left.
-[Jaegyun] Just one left.

518
00:24:16,997 --> 00:24:18,123
JUNSEO IS DOWN TO AN 8

519
00:24:18,207 --> 00:24:19,333
-Now then...
-Let's go.

520
00:24:19,416 --> 00:24:22,503
I can go tag any of those four.

521
00:24:23,170 --> 00:24:26,090
[Horseking] Right, since you have a 2,
it's your turn to step in.

522
00:24:32,346 --> 00:24:33,347
[sighs]

523
00:24:34,932 --> 00:24:36,141
I played a 3 and lost.

524
00:24:37,226 --> 00:24:38,268
-You lost?
-[Junseo] Yes.

525
00:24:38,352 --> 00:24:39,645
[Pani Bottle] He had a stronger card.

526
00:24:39,728 --> 00:24:41,063
[sighs heavily]

527
00:24:42,648 --> 00:24:44,274
[Ddolddol] They'll now try
to eliminate Junseo.

528
00:24:44,900 --> 00:24:47,111
-Then, he has a 2 and 3 now?
-Yes.

529
00:24:47,194 --> 00:24:48,612
I think that's okay though.

530
00:24:49,113 --> 00:24:50,197
That seems okay.

531
00:24:50,280 --> 00:24:51,615
Now, he has a 2 and 3.

532
00:24:53,075 --> 00:24:54,451
Then, I can beat that.

533
00:24:54,952 --> 00:24:56,704
I can beat Joonsu for sure.

534
00:24:57,454 --> 00:24:59,289
You can beat Joonsu for sure.

535
00:24:59,915 --> 00:25:01,083
You can tag Dail or Joonsu.

536
00:25:01,166 --> 00:25:02,835
-I can get him.
-[Ddolddol] Yeah.

537
00:25:02,918 --> 00:25:05,337
Then, I'm better off doing it
since I have a 5.

538
00:25:05,421 --> 00:25:07,256
-[Jimin] Yes. It's the same.
-It's the same.

539
00:25:07,339 --> 00:25:09,508
I thought about it and realized

540
00:25:09,591 --> 00:25:12,511
that with Junseo's 3 gone,

541
00:25:12,594 --> 00:25:15,389
Joonsu was guaranteed to have the 2 and 3.

542
00:25:16,015 --> 00:25:18,350
We'd seen all of Joonsu's cards now.

543
00:25:18,934 --> 00:25:22,813
We could take him out for sure,
so our target became Lee Joonsu.

544
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:25,441
WITH HIS CARDS KNOWN,
JOONSU BECOMES THE TARGET

545
00:25:25,524 --> 00:25:27,985
Joonsu will get involved again.
They'll come together.

546
00:25:28,068 --> 00:25:32,156
[Pani Bottle] If you see Joonsu near me
when I'm hiding,

547
00:25:32,239 --> 00:25:33,490
-go after him.
-[alarm blaring]

548
00:25:33,574 --> 00:25:35,117
Go for him! Go, go!

549
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:37,411
[host] The Battle Round has begun.

550
00:25:38,078 --> 00:25:39,830
[♪ thrilling music playing]

551
00:25:41,999 --> 00:25:43,000
[Pani Bottle coughs]

552
00:25:45,002 --> 00:25:49,173
RED TEAM PLANS TO AMBUSH JOONSU

553
00:25:50,424 --> 00:25:53,010
KIM DDOLDDOL IS OFF TO GET HORSEKING

554
00:25:53,093 --> 00:25:55,220
-[Ddolddol] Who are they?
-[Jimin] Horseking, Joonsu!

555
00:25:55,304 --> 00:25:56,597
[Ddolddol] Horseking and Joonsu!

556
00:25:58,640 --> 00:25:59,892
[Pani Bottle] Is Joonsu here?

557
00:26:00,476 --> 00:26:02,603
-[Jimin] Joonsu.
-Is he with Horseking?

558
00:26:02,686 --> 00:26:06,899
[sighs] It feels like Horseking
will lose Ddolddol and run like hell.

559
00:26:08,859 --> 00:26:10,486
-Be careful.
-[Ddolddol] How about heading back?

560
00:26:11,987 --> 00:26:13,572
It's pointless to tag each other.

561
00:26:13,655 --> 00:26:14,990
-[Ddolddol] That's true.
-Yes.

562
00:26:16,325 --> 00:26:18,327
[♪ thrilling music intensifies]

563
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:27,711
[Jimin] Joonsu's coming!

564
00:26:31,131 --> 00:26:33,258
-Why are you coming?
-[Joonsu] What?

565
00:26:35,135 --> 00:26:37,179
-[Pani Bottle] Be careful.
-[alarm blaring]

566
00:26:37,262 --> 00:26:38,263
PANI BOTTLE TAGS JOONSU

567
00:26:38,347 --> 00:26:39,389
[host] Tag confirmed.

568
00:26:44,394 --> 00:26:46,730
PANI BOTTLE

569
00:26:46,814 --> 00:26:48,524
[Joonsu] This is mine.

570
00:26:48,607 --> 00:26:50,692
[dealer] Pani Bottle has won.

571
00:26:51,527 --> 00:26:52,528
[Pani Bottle] Okay.

572
00:26:52,611 --> 00:26:54,696
He played a 3, and I won.

573
00:26:54,780 --> 00:26:55,781
-[Ddolddol] Nice.
-[Jimin] We won.

574
00:26:55,864 --> 00:26:56,865
-You played your 5?
-Yes.

575
00:26:56,949 --> 00:26:58,200
-[Ddolddol] No way.
-Then, he must have a 2.

576
00:26:58,283 --> 00:26:59,284
-Yeah, a 2.
-Right.

577
00:26:59,368 --> 00:27:01,203
-[Jimin] Tag him.
-[Pani Bottle] We have to go for Joonsu.

578
00:27:01,286 --> 00:27:02,704
-[Junseo] Yeah.
-[Pani Bottle] The best move

579
00:27:02,788 --> 00:27:05,124
is to put all focus on Joonsu
and eliminate him first.

580
00:27:05,207 --> 00:27:08,252
If we eliminate Joonsu this time,
we'll have a huge advantage.

581
00:27:08,335 --> 00:27:11,672
So when I start, I'll run like hell,
hide, and go after Joonsu. Okay?

582
00:27:11,755 --> 00:27:12,756
-[Ddolddol] Yes.
-Sounds good.

583
00:27:13,882 --> 00:27:16,468
-[alarm blaring]
-[host] The Battle Round has begun.

584
00:27:17,177 --> 00:27:19,638
[Ddolddol] It's Horseking and Joonsu.
It's the same as before.

585
00:27:19,721 --> 00:27:20,722
SAME STAND-OFF AS BEFORE

586
00:27:20,806 --> 00:27:22,599
-Go!
-[Ddolddol] Wait, timeout! [laughs]

587
00:27:22,683 --> 00:27:23,684
Timeout.

588
00:27:23,767 --> 00:27:25,227
[Horseking] It's okay! Go!

589
00:27:25,310 --> 00:27:27,604
[Ddolddol] Timeout. Hey, Joonsu's coming!

590
00:27:27,688 --> 00:27:29,064
[Horseking] Okay, be careful!

591
00:27:29,147 --> 00:27:30,315
JIMIN WAITING TO AMBUSH

592
00:27:33,944 --> 00:27:34,945
[Joonsu grunts]

593
00:27:35,028 --> 00:27:36,613
-[Jimin] I got you! Tag!
-[alarm blaring]

594
00:27:36,697 --> 00:27:38,156
[host] Tag confirmed.

595
00:27:38,782 --> 00:27:41,285
I don't have any other card now.

596
00:27:42,911 --> 00:27:45,873
PARK JIMIN, LEE JOONSU

597
00:27:45,956 --> 00:27:47,332
There's no need to think.

598
00:27:48,166 --> 00:27:51,003
[panting]

599
00:27:51,086 --> 00:27:53,213
RED TEAM SUCCEEDS IN DEFEATING JOONSU

600
00:27:55,173 --> 00:27:56,174
I won.

601
00:27:57,968 --> 00:27:58,969
-A 2?
-[Jimin] Yeah, 2.

602
00:27:59,052 --> 00:28:00,220
-You beat a 2 with the 6?
-What?

603
00:28:00,304 --> 00:28:01,305
You beat a 2 with the 6?

604
00:28:01,388 --> 00:28:03,515
-I--
-[Ddolddol] Then Joonsu's out, right?

605
00:28:03,599 --> 00:28:04,600
-He's out.
-[Ddolddol] Nice.

606
00:28:04,683 --> 00:28:06,727
How about we get more aggressive?

607
00:28:07,728 --> 00:28:10,022
-Wait, do they tell us when someone's out?
-Yes.

608
00:28:10,105 --> 00:28:11,106
Yeah, ZZONE--

609
00:28:11,189 --> 00:28:12,608
Yet he survived?

610
00:28:13,191 --> 00:28:14,568
-They let us know?
-Yes, when someone's out.

611
00:28:14,651 --> 00:28:15,652
[Ddolddol] They'd let us know.

612
00:28:16,236 --> 00:28:17,779
-He could have the Joker.
-[gasps]

613
00:28:18,322 --> 00:28:19,656
-Out...
-[Jimin] What if...

614
00:28:19,740 --> 00:28:21,575
THE PLAYER WITH THE JOKER
HAS THREE CARDS

615
00:28:22,159 --> 00:28:23,619
Joonsu is the Joker?

616
00:28:25,370 --> 00:28:27,372
-Joonsu is the Joker?
-[Pani Bottle] The Joker?

617
00:28:27,873 --> 00:28:30,125
Joker? He's the Joker?

618
00:28:31,251 --> 00:28:34,212
Is that possible?
If the alarm goes off now, he's the Joker.

619
00:28:35,213 --> 00:28:36,590
Fuck.

620
00:28:44,556 --> 00:28:45,807
[alarm blaring]

621
00:28:45,891 --> 00:28:47,017
So...

622
00:28:47,100 --> 00:28:48,685
He is! He's the Joker!

623
00:28:50,187 --> 00:28:51,313
The Joker for Joonsu?

624
00:28:51,396 --> 00:28:53,398
Yes, we can't change it now.

625
00:28:53,482 --> 00:28:56,151
-This should be our cheat code.
-[ZZONE] I bet they won't expect this.

626
00:28:56,234 --> 00:28:57,235
JOKER

627
00:28:57,319 --> 00:28:59,905
[Jaegyun] Let's give it to Joonsu,
the last person they'd expect.

628
00:28:59,988 --> 00:29:04,576
[ZZONE] Then, Joonsu has 9, 4,
and the Joker.

629
00:29:04,660 --> 00:29:05,994
LEE JOONSU, JOKER

630
00:29:07,412 --> 00:29:08,455
[ZZONE and Dail sigh]

631
00:29:08,538 --> 00:29:13,168
That was a mistake. Jimin got 2,
and they found out Joonsu is the Joker.

632
00:29:14,711 --> 00:29:16,046
What a headache.

633
00:29:16,713 --> 00:29:18,298
I should've gone with him.

634
00:29:19,549 --> 00:29:21,051
-[ZZONE sniffles]
-[sighs]

635
00:29:21,134 --> 00:29:23,220
I really panicked at that moment.

636
00:29:24,513 --> 00:29:27,140
-The Joker was a little too bold.
-They pulled a fast one on us.

637
00:29:27,224 --> 00:29:29,142
They've been bluffing
in front of us big time.

638
00:29:29,226 --> 00:29:30,602
-It began with that notebook.
-[Jimin] Yeah.

639
00:29:30,686 --> 00:29:32,562
-The King was pointless?
-Yeah.

640
00:29:32,646 --> 00:29:35,691
Their Joker only has one card,
so he's actually more vulnerable.

641
00:29:35,774 --> 00:29:39,069
We've figured out their Joker,
while they have no idea about our Joker.

642
00:29:39,152 --> 00:29:41,029
If we get Joonsu, that's huge.

643
00:29:41,113 --> 00:29:43,490
If I get Joonsu,
the game is basically over.

644
00:29:43,573 --> 00:29:44,866
-[Jimin] Right.
-Yeah.

645
00:29:45,450 --> 00:29:49,746
RED TEAM GAINS UPPER HAND
BY FINDING OUT THE OTHER JOKER

646
00:29:49,830 --> 00:29:51,957
[Joonsu] So, if I get tagged by Ddolddol,

647
00:29:52,040 --> 00:29:53,417
it's basically over for us.

648
00:29:53,500 --> 00:29:55,168
-It's over.
-Nothing would beat the King.

649
00:29:55,252 --> 00:29:56,253
[Joonsu] Then, how do we win?

650
00:29:56,336 --> 00:29:58,130
-We have to get their Joker.
-[ZZONE] Yes.

651
00:29:58,880 --> 00:30:01,299
THEY COULD LOSE THEIR JOKER

652
00:30:01,383 --> 00:30:04,302
-Anyway, we don't know their Joker?
-[Jaegyun] We don't.

653
00:30:04,386 --> 00:30:06,513
These three might have the Joker,

654
00:30:06,596 --> 00:30:08,056
but we have to tag them.

655
00:30:08,140 --> 00:30:09,641
-[Dail] Right.
-[Horseking] Yes.

656
00:30:09,725 --> 00:30:11,768
[Jaegyun] We need to eliminate
at least one of them.

657
00:30:11,852 --> 00:30:13,687
-Right. Right.
-[Jaegyun] We need to isolate them.

658
00:30:13,770 --> 00:30:16,023
That's how we'll know,
but we haven't eliminated anyone.

659
00:30:16,106 --> 00:30:17,691
Let's go together this time.

660
00:30:17,774 --> 00:30:18,817
[alarm blaring]

661
00:30:18,900 --> 00:30:20,610
[host] The Battle Round has begun.

662
00:30:21,528 --> 00:30:24,072
JOONSU RUSHES OUT
AS SOON AS THE ROUND STARTS

663
00:30:29,327 --> 00:30:31,747
[Joonsu] I ran over to the reeds
as soon as we started.

664
00:30:40,797 --> 00:30:42,424
[gasps] I can see the stars.

665
00:30:43,133 --> 00:30:45,135
They figured out that I was the Joker.

666
00:30:45,218 --> 00:30:46,553
-[Jaegyun] Stay hidden.
-I'll hide.

667
00:30:46,636 --> 00:30:47,929
-[Jaegyun] Stay hidden.
-You keep hiding.

668
00:30:48,013 --> 00:30:49,598
-[Jaegyun] Keep hiding.
-Stay in the reeds.

669
00:30:49,681 --> 00:30:51,266
[Joonsu] I said "Okay" and hid.

670
00:30:51,975 --> 00:30:54,102
I just stayed there quietly.

671
00:30:54,186 --> 00:30:56,438
Until we figure out who the Joker is,

672
00:30:56,521 --> 00:31:00,067
we need to play it very safe.

673
00:31:02,944 --> 00:31:03,945
Hey, Boss.

674
00:31:04,613 --> 00:31:07,282
-[Ddolddol laughs] Why are you alone?
-Why not?

675
00:31:07,365 --> 00:31:10,202
-[Ddolddol] They must have gone off.
-Yes, I just need to wait.

676
00:31:10,285 --> 00:31:12,788
KIM DDOLDDOL BLOCKS HORSEKING

677
00:31:13,830 --> 00:31:16,291
-I want to go in.
-No, Horseking.

678
00:31:16,374 --> 00:31:18,460
-[Horseking] I know.
-Don't cross this line.

679
00:31:18,543 --> 00:31:20,712
-You can't.
-[Horseking] I know. I totally understand.

680
00:31:22,089 --> 00:31:24,091
[♪ light music playing]

681
00:31:28,804 --> 00:31:33,975
BLUE TEAM HAS TO ELIMINATE SOMEONE

682
00:31:36,603 --> 00:31:37,729
[Jaegyun] Not here.

683
00:31:38,647 --> 00:31:39,648
No one's here.

684
00:31:43,568 --> 00:31:45,987
RED TEAM IS NOWHERE TO BE FOUND

685
00:31:49,407 --> 00:31:51,201
[Dail] Geez, I can't believe this.

686
00:31:53,078 --> 00:31:54,079
[Eunsil whispers] Jimin.

687
00:31:55,163 --> 00:31:58,667
ZZONE and Jaegyun are waiting down there.
They're in front of the door.

688
00:32:00,043 --> 00:32:01,378
They're at the door.

689
00:32:01,461 --> 00:32:02,462
UPDATING JUNSEO

690
00:32:02,546 --> 00:32:03,755
ZZONE.

691
00:32:06,091 --> 00:32:08,426
-[Jimin] Once they come upstairs...
-[Eunsil] I'll tag them.

692
00:32:09,386 --> 00:32:11,847
[Ddolddol] It seems like
one person's missing.

693
00:32:11,930 --> 00:32:13,807
There should be four of them there.

694
00:32:17,018 --> 00:32:18,728
-Tag.
-[host] Tag confirmed.

695
00:32:18,812 --> 00:32:20,230
KIM DDOLDDOL TAGS HORSEKING

696
00:32:21,148 --> 00:32:22,858
A TIE BETWEEN KINGS

697
00:32:22,941 --> 00:32:24,860
-Come on.
-[Horseking] Let me inside.

698
00:32:24,943 --> 00:32:26,486
-[Ddolddol] No.
-[Horseking sighs]

699
00:32:26,570 --> 00:32:29,948
[Horseking] Did you get training?
You're pretty good at defense.

700
00:32:30,031 --> 00:32:31,575
[Ddolddol] No, nothing like that.

701
00:32:31,658 --> 00:32:33,201
I've got so much to do though.

702
00:32:33,785 --> 00:32:36,329
I need to get rid of Jimin
and Pani Bottle.

703
00:32:38,123 --> 00:32:39,833
[Ddolddol laughing] Tag!

704
00:32:39,916 --> 00:32:41,585
-[host] Tag confirmed.
-[Ddolddol] Stay away.

705
00:32:41,668 --> 00:32:42,669
They're not coming.

706
00:32:42,752 --> 00:32:44,129
DDOLDDOL'S SECOND SUCCESSFUL DEFENSE

707
00:32:44,212 --> 00:32:45,714
How long are you going to do this?

708
00:32:45,797 --> 00:32:46,798
[Ddolddol] Beats me.

709
00:32:46,882 --> 00:32:49,593
[Horseking] This is driving me crazy.
Am I the one who's bad at this?

710
00:32:49,676 --> 00:32:51,052
KIM DDOLDDOL'S IMPENETRABLE DEFENSE

711
00:32:52,095 --> 00:32:54,139
10 HOURS HAVE PASSED

712
00:32:54,764 --> 00:32:57,517
[Jaegyun] They're all hiding
and won't come out.

713
00:32:57,601 --> 00:33:00,061
[ZZONE sighs] Where could they be?

714
00:33:00,145 --> 00:33:03,398
They were hiding and refusing to come out.
Time was ticking.

715
00:33:03,481 --> 00:33:04,858
HELPLESS AGAINST RED TEAM'S DEFENSE

716
00:33:04,941 --> 00:33:06,610
All they did was play defense.

717
00:33:06,693 --> 00:33:09,237
There was nothing we could do.
I felt so frustrated.

718
00:33:09,821 --> 00:33:13,116
[Dail] I can't believe we've been playing
the game for 10 hours.

719
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:15,744
Only Ddolddol's walking around.
The other four are all hiding.

720
00:33:15,827 --> 00:33:16,828
[exhales heavily]

721
00:33:17,329 --> 00:33:18,997
They're not going to move at all?

722
00:33:19,080 --> 00:33:21,458
-They know they have the upper hand.
-Of course.

723
00:33:21,541 --> 00:33:23,376
They're not coming out.

724
00:33:23,460 --> 00:33:27,672
They're now lying on the pitch
and not getting up.

725
00:33:27,756 --> 00:33:31,927
It made me mad and worked up.

726
00:33:32,010 --> 00:33:34,054
-We need to find symbols.
-[Jaegyun] Yes, we should.

727
00:33:34,137 --> 00:33:35,805
Right, no matter what.

728
00:33:35,889 --> 00:33:37,682
-Just force them to crawl out?
-[Dail] Yes.

729
00:33:37,766 --> 00:33:40,018
So we smoke them
out of their little hideout?

730
00:33:40,101 --> 00:33:41,853
Wait them out? Okay, got it.

731
00:33:41,937 --> 00:33:44,773
We decided to find all 10 symbols.

732
00:33:44,856 --> 00:33:47,192
Fine, no one's coming out from the base.

733
00:33:47,275 --> 00:33:49,611
We might as well find the symbols
and get rid of them.

734
00:33:49,694 --> 00:33:51,196
Let's lay out rat poison
and wait them out.

735
00:33:51,279 --> 00:33:52,948
I started feeling more determined.

736
00:33:53,031 --> 00:33:54,407
We have to win this.

737
00:33:56,618 --> 00:34:00,121
This place is so narrow.
You practically picked a fortress.

738
00:34:00,997 --> 00:34:02,332
It's a fortress.

739
00:34:02,874 --> 00:34:05,335
You're like Zhang Fei at Changban Bridge.

740
00:34:07,337 --> 00:34:08,838
[chuckles] This is driving me nuts.

741
00:34:10,131 --> 00:34:11,549
It's pointless between us.

742
00:34:11,633 --> 00:34:14,094
So let's wait until they tag each other.

743
00:34:16,513 --> 00:34:18,139
[ZZONE whispering] Jaegyun.

744
00:34:18,223 --> 00:34:19,349
Be really careful.

745
00:34:19,432 --> 00:34:22,060
[Jaegyun] Are they on this side?
This side?

746
00:34:22,143 --> 00:34:24,854
-[ZZONE] Isn't this the Neutral Zone?
-[Jaegyun] Right.

747
00:34:26,189 --> 00:34:27,190
Let's find them.

748
00:34:28,817 --> 00:34:30,527
[ZZONE] It feels like they'll be here.

749
00:34:32,445 --> 00:34:35,824
RED TEAM BASE, 1ST FLOOR

750
00:34:35,907 --> 00:34:39,327
RED TEAM BASE, 2ND FLOOR

751
00:34:40,245 --> 00:34:43,873
RED TEAM IS STILL HIDING
ON THE 2ND FLOOR

752
00:34:49,170 --> 00:34:50,297
[Jaegyun pants]

753
00:34:50,380 --> 00:34:51,840
Why aren't they here?

754
00:34:53,466 --> 00:34:54,467
[object thuds]

755
00:34:56,303 --> 00:34:58,638
-[Ddolddol] Someone's hiding back there.
-[laughs smugly]

756
00:34:58,722 --> 00:35:00,432
Who could that be?

757
00:35:01,224 --> 00:35:02,225
Don't look.

758
00:35:02,309 --> 00:35:05,979
WHILE HORSEKING DISTRACTS DDOLDDOL

759
00:35:19,451 --> 00:35:20,994
[exhales] I just need to find one.

760
00:35:21,494 --> 00:35:24,789
I wanted to find a symbol so badly.
It was so hard to find.

761
00:35:24,873 --> 00:35:26,666
Time kept ticking away.

762
00:35:27,375 --> 00:35:29,628
I was getting more and more desperate.

763
00:35:32,505 --> 00:35:33,506
[Jimin] Eunsil.

764
00:35:39,179 --> 00:35:41,181
[♪ foreboding music playing]

765
00:35:52,525 --> 00:35:53,777
[Eunsil whispers] They're inside.

766
00:35:54,527 --> 00:35:55,779
[object clangs]

767
00:35:55,862 --> 00:35:57,364
They're rummaging around.

768
00:36:28,228 --> 00:36:29,229
[hinges creak]

769
00:36:45,829 --> 00:36:48,540
[Jimin whispers] We need to catch the one
who'll sacrifice themselves.

770
00:36:48,623 --> 00:36:49,624
[sighs]

771
00:36:50,542 --> 00:36:51,793
[Eunsil] Want to go to the second floor?

772
00:37:07,600 --> 00:37:09,728
[♪ epic music playing]

773
00:37:09,811 --> 00:37:12,021
[Jaegyun] There it was.
That feeling I felt then

774
00:37:12,105 --> 00:37:14,858
was something
I really can't put into words.

775
00:37:14,941 --> 00:37:19,112
I wanted to shout, but if I did,
the other team would come.

776
00:37:19,195 --> 00:37:22,657
I celebrated on the inside
and took it with me.

777
00:37:33,835 --> 00:37:35,754
I ran so fast like my ass was on fire.

778
00:37:37,756 --> 00:37:38,757
The fourth one.

779
00:37:38,840 --> 00:37:39,841
BLUE TEAM TAKES FOURTH SYMBOL

780
00:37:39,924 --> 00:37:41,843
-Wait, what's this?
-[Ddolddol] Stop lying.

781
00:37:41,926 --> 00:37:44,012
"Blue Team retrieved the fourth symbol."

782
00:37:44,095 --> 00:37:47,390
"Red Team's 8 card
is held by Yuk Junseo." Nice!

783
00:37:48,558 --> 00:37:49,559
Okay!

784
00:37:52,479 --> 00:37:57,066
When it was broken, the 8 was revealed
according to the 4 card rule.

785
00:37:57,150 --> 00:37:59,319
Didn't they say if we broke four,
we'd know who had the 4?

786
00:37:59,402 --> 00:38:03,573
Yeah, so if there's no 4,
it goes to 5, then 6, then 7, and then 8.

787
00:38:03,656 --> 00:38:06,367
-That means 4, 5, 6, 7 are gone.
-Right.

788
00:38:06,451 --> 00:38:09,037
[Jaegyun] Let's run
through the possibilities.

789
00:38:09,120 --> 00:38:14,417
[Horseking] From 1 to 9, there's no 9.

790
00:38:14,501 --> 00:38:16,085
-[Jaegyun] It's an 8.
-They don't have these.

791
00:38:16,169 --> 00:38:18,546
-[Jaegyun] No, they don't.
-Then, it's 1, 2, 3, and 8.

792
00:38:18,630 --> 00:38:19,923
[Jaegyun] Yeah, he's got an 8.

793
00:38:20,006 --> 00:38:22,383
[Horseking] The only combinations
are 1, 2, and 3.

794
00:38:22,967 --> 00:38:24,135
Eunsil has the 1!

795
00:38:24,636 --> 00:38:26,137
[panting]

796
00:38:27,722 --> 00:38:29,933
-We got it. It's a 1.
-[Horseking] It's over.

797
00:38:30,433 --> 00:38:34,062
THE MYSTERY BEHIND THE 1 AND 3 CARDS

798
00:38:34,145 --> 00:38:36,481
WHICH ONE IS EUNSIL'S CARD?

799
00:38:36,564 --> 00:38:40,527
I have the 1 and 7 cards.

800
00:38:41,027 --> 00:38:42,237
It's confirmed. Eunsil has a 1.

801
00:38:42,320 --> 00:38:43,905
BLUE TEAM CORRECTLY MATCHES
EUNSIL'S CARD

802
00:38:43,988 --> 00:38:45,990
Ddolddol is the one with 3.

803
00:38:47,033 --> 00:38:48,284
I'll take the King and 3.

804
00:38:48,368 --> 00:38:49,369
KIM DDOLDDOL'S CARDS

805
00:38:49,452 --> 00:38:51,663
-Ddolddol has the 3.
-Yes. And Eunsil has the 1.

806
00:38:51,746 --> 00:38:52,747
GETS DDOLDDOL'S CARD RIGHT TOO

807
00:38:58,628 --> 00:38:59,712
[Dail] It was super helpful.

808
00:38:59,796 --> 00:39:02,799
It's the incredible power
of the 4 card rule.

809
00:39:04,968 --> 00:39:06,219
[Pani Bottle]
Then, the 1 has been revealed.

810
00:39:06,302 --> 00:39:08,680
-[Ddolddol] They know all our cards now.
-Right.

811
00:39:08,763 --> 00:39:11,057
[Pani Bottle sighs] Then, what do we do?

812
00:39:11,850 --> 00:39:13,226
[sighs heavily]

813
00:39:13,726 --> 00:39:14,727
[exhales]

814
00:39:15,520 --> 00:39:17,981
We're sticking with the same strategy.

815
00:39:18,064 --> 00:39:21,109
Tag either Jaegyun or Joonsu.

816
00:39:21,776 --> 00:39:25,280
If we manage to take their Joker,
then until the game's over,

817
00:39:25,363 --> 00:39:27,490
-just stay hidden forever.
-I can do that.

818
00:39:27,574 --> 00:39:30,243
The Joker can change with three more,
so they'll come for sure.

819
00:39:30,326 --> 00:39:32,078
CAN SHUFFLE CARDS
AFTER RETRIEVING 7 SYMBOLS

820
00:39:32,161 --> 00:39:33,162
We'd just need to wait.

821
00:39:33,246 --> 00:39:35,748
THEY FIGURE BLUE TEAM
WILL COME TO RETRIEVE SYMBOLS

822
00:39:35,832 --> 00:39:38,126
Hey, let's do it with style.

823
00:39:38,209 --> 00:39:39,210
[Dail] Okay.

824
00:39:39,294 --> 00:39:41,713
-And get Junseo. Go out in style.
-Yeah. With style.

825
00:39:41,796 --> 00:39:43,673
I'll just charge at whoever I see.

826
00:39:43,756 --> 00:39:48,219
If I replace Junseo's 8 with my 1,

827
00:39:48,303 --> 00:39:51,764
Horseking won't have any numbers
that can threaten him.

828
00:39:51,848 --> 00:39:53,892
He'll be free to move around.

829
00:39:54,392 --> 00:39:56,561
If you just take Junseo down

830
00:39:56,644 --> 00:39:58,146
and lower his number,

831
00:39:58,229 --> 00:40:01,608
no matter if this person, this person,
or this person has the Joker,

832
00:40:01,691 --> 00:40:03,109
they're all done for if I use my 5.

833
00:40:03,192 --> 00:40:04,986
[Jaegyun] The 5 can beat anyone.

834
00:40:05,069 --> 00:40:08,114
They'll be done for.
And we can just go straight in.

835
00:40:08,197 --> 00:40:12,201
As the King, I absolutely needed a card
with a higher number than their Joker.

836
00:40:12,285 --> 00:40:16,164
If their Joker's other number card
is greater than mine,

837
00:40:16,247 --> 00:40:20,209
they would play it, beat mine,
and take my number.

838
00:40:20,293 --> 00:40:23,379
Then, I'd be left with only the King
and no way to defend myself.

839
00:40:24,422 --> 00:40:25,590
On the other hand,

840
00:40:25,673 --> 00:40:28,384
if their Joker's number card
is lower than mine,

841
00:40:28,468 --> 00:40:31,804
I can defend myself with my number card
regardless of what the Joker plays.

842
00:40:31,888 --> 00:40:33,514
[Dail] Hey, this time,

843
00:40:33,598 --> 00:40:36,559
let's stay calm and get this done.

844
00:40:36,643 --> 00:40:37,894
Dail has to endure so much.

845
00:40:37,977 --> 00:40:39,228
-Seriously.
-Not at all.

846
00:40:39,312 --> 00:40:42,398
-[ZZONE] How bad is it?
-It feels like it burst again.

847
00:40:43,483 --> 00:40:47,320
Even if my toe falls off,
I can't let the game end like this.

848
00:40:47,403 --> 00:40:49,781
I'll see this game through to the end.

849
00:40:49,864 --> 00:40:50,865
So that's why

850
00:40:51,407 --> 00:40:54,702
both sides decided to go
with the sacrifice play.

851
00:40:55,828 --> 00:40:58,289
[alarm blaring]

852
00:40:58,373 --> 00:40:59,540
[host] The Battle Round has begun.

853
00:40:59,624 --> 00:41:00,792
12 HOURS HAVE PASSED

854
00:41:02,043 --> 00:41:04,796
NO ONE'S COMING TO RED TEAM BASE

855
00:41:06,339 --> 00:41:07,340
[object rustling]

856
00:41:14,555 --> 00:41:16,557
[♪ intriguing music playing]

857
00:41:18,351 --> 00:41:19,435
[whispering] Are they inside?

858
00:41:19,519 --> 00:41:20,853
No, no one's here.

859
00:41:21,521 --> 00:41:23,940
-You haven't seen Joonsu, right?
-No, he's not here.

860
00:41:24,482 --> 00:41:26,651
[Junseo] Blue Team didn't come this time.

861
00:41:27,735 --> 00:41:30,321
-Did they come in at all?
-Nope.

862
00:41:31,030 --> 00:41:32,657
[sighs] What's going on?

863
00:41:32,740 --> 00:41:35,368
Some of them are coming. Yang Dail and...

864
00:41:35,451 --> 00:41:37,036
-Four of them.
-[Pani Bottle] Who?

865
00:41:37,120 --> 00:41:38,621
[Eunsil] Yang Dail and ZZONE.

866
00:41:38,705 --> 00:41:40,123
Dail is limping.

867
00:41:40,206 --> 00:41:41,791
BLUE TEAM SEEN IN FRONT OF THE REEDS

868
00:41:44,877 --> 00:41:46,879
Are they going to the right?

869
00:41:47,588 --> 00:41:48,673
What do we do?

870
00:41:48,756 --> 00:41:52,552
[Jimin] They suddenly went into the reeds
to look for symbols, so it was weird.

871
00:41:53,386 --> 00:41:54,971
[Horseking groans] Geez.

872
00:41:55,555 --> 00:41:56,681
Please, just let one show up.

873
00:41:56,764 --> 00:41:58,141
[ZZONE] Please.

874
00:41:58,224 --> 00:42:01,060
BLUE TEAM SEARCHES THE REEDS FOR SYMBOLS

875
00:42:01,894 --> 00:42:04,022
[Horseking] Be careful not to step on it.

876
00:42:04,105 --> 00:42:05,440
[ZZONE] Okay.

877
00:42:08,276 --> 00:42:10,903
[Jimin sighs] It's really hard
to tag someone if they go in there.

878
00:42:10,987 --> 00:42:12,071
[Eunsil] I know.

879
00:42:13,364 --> 00:42:15,450
It feels like we have to do something now.

880
00:42:15,950 --> 00:42:17,785
[Jimin] Horseking went in there
to look for symbols.

881
00:42:17,869 --> 00:42:20,872
-Three of them are searching.
-How about we all go into their base?

882
00:42:20,955 --> 00:42:22,874
-All of us?
-[Jimin] Yes.

883
00:42:22,957 --> 00:42:26,085
I think we can sneak around from behind.
They're all focused on that.

884
00:42:26,169 --> 00:42:28,296
-And Joonsu could be alone at the base.
-[♪ rock music playing]

885
00:42:28,379 --> 00:42:30,840
But we have to move quickly.

886
00:42:30,923 --> 00:42:33,009
Let's make the first move.

887
00:42:33,092 --> 00:42:35,636
It's better than having them wait us out.

888
00:42:35,720 --> 00:42:37,722
They're all in the reeds anyway.

889
00:42:37,805 --> 00:42:39,807
-[Ddolddol] Yes.
-[Horseking] It'll take time for Horseking

890
00:42:39,891 --> 00:42:41,392
to crawl out of the reeds.

891
00:42:42,435 --> 00:42:44,562
Now's our chance while they're distracted.

892
00:42:46,022 --> 00:42:49,609
BLUE TEAM'S FOCUSED ON FINDING SYMBOLS

893
00:42:57,784 --> 00:42:59,535
[Junseo] Ddolddol, you go forward.

894
00:42:59,619 --> 00:43:01,162
[Jimin] I think we should head this way.

895
00:43:01,245 --> 00:43:02,580
-I'll search.
-You should go that way.

896
00:43:02,663 --> 00:43:03,998
[Dail] There they are!

897
00:43:04,707 --> 00:43:06,209
RED TEAM SPOTTED

898
00:43:06,292 --> 00:43:08,669
-[Horseking] Okay. Who is it?
-All of them are here!

899
00:43:08,753 --> 00:43:09,879
-They're all coming.
-They're all here.

900
00:43:09,962 --> 00:43:10,963
Get ready!

901
00:43:11,047 --> 00:43:12,381
THE BLUE TEAM COMES OUT ON CUE

902
00:43:12,465 --> 00:43:15,343
[groans] The Red Team
had stubbornly done nothing

903
00:43:15,426 --> 00:43:18,471
but defend and hole up in their fortress,

904
00:43:18,554 --> 00:43:21,891
so our plan was to lure them out.

905
00:43:21,974 --> 00:43:22,975
[sighs]

906
00:43:23,810 --> 00:43:25,353
We're in trouble.

907
00:43:29,065 --> 00:43:30,108
Here they come.

908
00:43:30,191 --> 00:43:31,192
Run.

909
00:43:33,361 --> 00:43:34,362
We have to run.

910
00:43:35,363 --> 00:43:37,156
[Jimin] We can't be caught by Yang Dail.

911
00:43:37,907 --> 00:43:39,700
-Yang Dail's coming.
-We can't let him tag us.

912
00:43:41,202 --> 00:43:43,204
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

913
00:43:44,956 --> 00:43:46,958
[Dail panting]

914
00:43:53,840 --> 00:43:55,341
I figured that was my moment.

915
00:43:57,343 --> 00:43:58,344
I was like, "Guys,

916
00:43:59,637 --> 00:44:00,638
I'm going in."

917
00:44:01,848 --> 00:44:03,975
"Yang Sacrifice is going in. This is it."

918
00:44:11,107 --> 00:44:13,818
I was ready to sacrifice myself
for the team.

919
00:44:16,904 --> 00:44:17,989
[Jimin] Junseo.

920
00:44:18,072 --> 00:44:20,032
[screams] Wait, no!

921
00:44:20,116 --> 00:44:22,994
-[alarm blaring]
-[host] Tag confirmed.

922
00:44:23,077 --> 00:44:24,245
[Horseking] Wait, what?

923
00:44:24,745 --> 00:44:25,746
What happened?

924
00:44:25,830 --> 00:44:28,166
[♪ intriguing music playing]

925
00:44:28,249 --> 00:44:30,877
-I guess it was a dogfight.
-[Horseking] Yeah. What happened?

926
00:44:33,171 --> 00:44:35,173
[panting]

927
00:44:45,516 --> 00:44:46,517
[Dail] My goodness.

928
00:44:48,686 --> 00:44:50,188
[♪ powerful music playing]

929
00:44:50,271 --> 00:44:51,272
Yuk Junseo!

930
00:44:51,355 --> 00:44:52,523
YANG DAIL TAGS YUK JUNSEO

931
00:44:54,317 --> 00:44:56,527
-This is insane.
-[Horseking] Yang Dail, Yuk Junseo!

932
00:44:57,278 --> 00:44:58,446
[chuckles]

933
00:44:59,405 --> 00:45:02,366
-Yang Dail! General Yang!
-[ZZONE laughing]

934
00:45:03,743 --> 00:45:08,122
Despite being injured,
Dail managed to tag Junseo.

935
00:45:08,206 --> 00:45:12,168
It was a play that went beyond
what he was physically capable of.

936
00:45:12,251 --> 00:45:14,045
It's like the goalkeeper went and scored.

937
00:45:16,005 --> 00:45:19,759
[Junseo] It was
right before Jimin got tagged.

938
00:45:19,842 --> 00:45:22,094
Junseo, you get him.

939
00:45:22,178 --> 00:45:25,181
[Junseo] She was calling out
because if she got caught again,

940
00:45:25,264 --> 00:45:26,891
the Joker would be revealed.

941
00:45:28,100 --> 00:45:29,977
I rushed forward and grabbed him.

942
00:45:31,729 --> 00:45:35,358
[Dail] I was going to tag Yuk Junseo.
Suddenly, he was protecting Jimin.

943
00:45:35,441 --> 00:45:37,568
I tagged him, saying, "Well, thanks."

944
00:45:38,402 --> 00:45:39,654
So, we went there and...

945
00:45:39,737 --> 00:45:41,572
Gosh, here's mine.

946
00:45:41,656 --> 00:45:44,325
I switched it to my 1 in the card battle.

947
00:45:44,408 --> 00:45:45,451
YANG DAIL, YUK JUNSEO

948
00:45:45,534 --> 00:45:48,621
[host] Yang Dail has been eliminated.

949
00:45:48,704 --> 00:45:51,207
[all cheering]

950
00:45:51,999 --> 00:45:53,084
[Horseking] Nice.

951
00:45:54,502 --> 00:45:56,462
[Dail] I've done my part for today.

952
00:45:59,757 --> 00:46:02,969
[host] Yang Dail has been eliminated.

953
00:46:05,596 --> 00:46:06,597
[Jimin sighs]

954
00:46:06,681 --> 00:46:08,099
-Good work, Junseo.
-Thanks.

955
00:46:08,182 --> 00:46:10,059
-[Jimin] What card is it?
-A 1.

956
00:46:10,142 --> 00:46:11,894
-A 1?
-Yes, we need to make a move now.

957
00:46:11,978 --> 00:46:13,396
-Was it a 1?
-[Eunsil] Yang Dail had a 1.

958
00:46:13,479 --> 00:46:14,772
[Junseo] Mine became a 1.

959
00:46:15,314 --> 00:46:16,565
My 8 has changed to a 1.

960
00:46:17,149 --> 00:46:18,776
Not a 2, but a 1.

961
00:46:18,859 --> 00:46:20,695
He pulled off the damn sacrifice play.

962
00:46:20,778 --> 00:46:22,863
Shit, I should've caught him.

963
00:46:23,739 --> 00:46:26,033
-I should've been tagged.
-[Junseo] Why?

964
00:46:26,117 --> 00:46:27,243
You know I have a 2.

965
00:46:27,952 --> 00:46:29,203
[sighs in disappointment]

966
00:46:31,831 --> 00:46:33,207
Now what do we do?

967
00:46:34,166 --> 00:46:37,545
[Pani Bottle] This one hurt a lot.
It was a big blow.

968
00:46:37,628 --> 00:46:39,380
[Eunsil] I was so frustrated.

969
00:46:43,467 --> 00:46:46,846
[Horseking] ♪ Ready or not, here I come ♪

970
00:46:48,347 --> 00:46:49,849
-They should be hiding.
-What?

971
00:46:49,932 --> 00:46:52,226
-I think they're hiding.
-Yeah, let's search this side.

972
00:46:52,310 --> 00:46:53,978
THE KING AND 5 COME CHARGING IN AGAIN

973
00:46:54,061 --> 00:46:57,857
♪ Ready or not, here I come ♪

974
00:47:03,112 --> 00:47:05,197
Is he alone? It sounds like he's alone.

975
00:47:06,240 --> 00:47:07,283
Who's there?

976
00:47:07,366 --> 00:47:08,534
HORSEKING WALKS AROUND FREELY

977
00:47:09,035 --> 00:47:10,036
Is he alone?

978
00:47:10,119 --> 00:47:11,537
THE RED TEAM HAS NO WAY TO STOP HIM

979
00:47:11,620 --> 00:47:12,621
Is he by himself?

980
00:47:14,373 --> 00:47:20,004
After that,
our morale really took a big hit.

981
00:47:20,963 --> 00:47:23,591
Yes, it wasn't easy at all.

982
00:47:24,175 --> 00:47:26,385
It was hard to keep it together.

983
00:47:26,469 --> 00:47:29,430
The Blue Team kept pressing us.

984
00:47:30,097 --> 00:47:32,058
-[Jimin grunts] Hold on.
-[Jaegyun] Tag.

985
00:47:32,141 --> 00:47:33,267
[Eunsil and Jaegyun] Tag!

986
00:47:33,351 --> 00:47:36,020
-[alarm blaring]
-[host] Tag confirmed.

987
00:47:39,148 --> 00:47:41,650
Jang Eunsil has been eliminated.

988
00:47:46,238 --> 00:47:47,698
-Now, ZZONE.
-[ZZONE] Yes?

989
00:47:47,782 --> 00:47:50,242
-You go there like earlier.
-[ZZONE] I'll bring it over this time.

990
00:47:50,326 --> 00:47:52,495
Bring it over, and we'll swap.
We'll win for sure.

991
00:47:52,578 --> 00:47:54,163
[♪ dramatic music playing]

992
00:47:54,246 --> 00:47:56,874
I'm out of it right now.
I can't think properly.

993
00:47:56,957 --> 00:47:58,000
[ZZONE] Here.

994
00:48:05,674 --> 00:48:07,009
[Jaegyun]
Give us the Shuffle Ticket, please.

995
00:48:10,971 --> 00:48:12,807
Let's go, ZZONE.

996
00:48:12,890 --> 00:48:14,767
[ZZONE] Shall we go switch right now?

997
00:48:14,850 --> 00:48:18,020
ZZONE had a 6 left,
so we decided to use a Shuffle Ticket.

998
00:48:18,104 --> 00:48:22,733
I'd switch with ZZONE
and use my 6 to take them down.

999
00:48:22,817 --> 00:48:25,778
-[dealer] The Shuffle Ticket will be used.
-[ZZONE] Okay.

1000
00:48:25,861 --> 00:48:28,572
[host] The Blue Team has used
their Shuffle Ticket.

1001
00:48:29,323 --> 00:48:30,324
THE RED TEAM IS HELPLESS

1002
00:48:30,408 --> 00:48:32,034
[Jimin] Horseking and a 1 card.

1003
00:48:33,119 --> 00:48:34,537
We got a message.

1004
00:48:34,620 --> 00:48:35,663
What is it?

1005
00:48:36,414 --> 00:48:38,249
WITH 7 SYMBOLS,
BLUE TEAM EARNS SHUFFLE TICKET

1006
00:48:38,332 --> 00:48:40,668
-They've retrieved seven symbols.
-[Ddolddol] A Shuffle Ticket?

1007
00:48:41,377 --> 00:48:43,087
[groans] Jaegyun got it.

1008
00:48:43,587 --> 00:48:45,339
The big card from ZZONE.

1009
00:48:45,423 --> 00:48:46,465
Is it a Joker?

1010
00:48:47,591 --> 00:48:48,592
They've been searching.

1011
00:48:48,676 --> 00:48:50,010
-Seven of them.
-[Pani Bottle] Right.

1012
00:48:50,094 --> 00:48:52,221
It's not a good idea to ignore searching.

1013
00:48:53,222 --> 00:48:54,598
Should we make a guess?

1014
00:48:55,433 --> 00:48:57,226
Maybe Joonsu now has a 6.

1015
00:48:57,309 --> 00:48:58,811
And ZZONE has the Joker?

1016
00:49:00,354 --> 00:49:02,231
-[Ddolddol] He must've passed the Joker.
-[Jimin] No.

1017
00:49:02,731 --> 00:49:04,859
I think ZZONE and Jaegyun would switch.

1018
00:49:05,693 --> 00:49:08,487
[Ddolddol] That will be it, 'cause Jaegyun
will come running toward us

1019
00:49:08,571 --> 00:49:09,822
with a 6 or 5.

1020
00:49:09,905 --> 00:49:11,991
[Pani Bottle] Jaegyun must've gotten a 6.

1021
00:49:12,074 --> 00:49:14,243
ZZONE has the 1, and Joonsu has the Joker.

1022
00:49:14,326 --> 00:49:15,870
So we definitely have to make our move.

1023
00:49:16,370 --> 00:49:19,999
It was like everything
that could go wrong went wrong.

1024
00:49:20,082 --> 00:49:24,753
It felt like all the bad luck
hit our team at once.

1025
00:49:25,629 --> 00:49:26,630
[sighs]

1026
00:49:26,714 --> 00:49:28,007
But Horseking...

1027
00:49:29,925 --> 00:49:31,010
Horseking...

1028
00:49:32,094 --> 00:49:34,305
We should go after Horseking. [sniffles]

1029
00:49:34,388 --> 00:49:36,432
It doesn't matter
who's tagged by Horseking.

1030
00:49:36,515 --> 00:49:39,185
Just like how we didn't know
that Joonsu was the Joker,

1031
00:49:39,268 --> 00:49:40,769
they can't rule anyone out.

1032
00:49:40,853 --> 00:49:43,939
If Horseking has a regular card,
he'll probably play it safe

1033
00:49:44,023 --> 00:49:45,399
if he still has it.

1034
00:49:45,483 --> 00:49:46,775
And he'd play that first.

1035
00:49:46,859 --> 00:49:48,110
-[Ddolddol] So, we have to be tagged.
-Yeah.

1036
00:49:48,194 --> 00:49:52,239
[Ddolddol] They're going to think,
"Why do they keep protecting Junseo?"

1037
00:49:52,323 --> 00:49:55,451
I don't think they've ruled him out
as the Joker yet.

1038
00:49:55,534 --> 00:49:57,453
They'll definitely assume
he'll play the Joker.

1039
00:49:57,536 --> 00:49:59,497
I think they'll suspect he's the Joker.

1040
00:49:59,580 --> 00:50:02,124
Normally, they'd expect Junseo to say,
"Let's do two-on-two."

1041
00:50:02,208 --> 00:50:03,209
[Jimin] Yes.

1042
00:50:03,292 --> 00:50:05,252
But if he doesn't come out
because of injury,

1043
00:50:05,336 --> 00:50:06,629
they might assume the Joker was hurt.

1044
00:50:06,712 --> 00:50:09,298
-They'll think they have the upper hand.
-[Jimin] Right.

1045
00:50:09,381 --> 00:50:13,219
Horseking probably thinks,
"Junseo's got something up his sleeves."

1046
00:50:13,302 --> 00:50:16,138
Because Junseo's been playing
very aggressively.

1047
00:50:16,222 --> 00:50:19,308
I think they're convinced
I'm holding the Joker.

1048
00:50:19,391 --> 00:50:20,935
Let's just tag Horseking.

1049
00:50:22,811 --> 00:50:26,065
This could actually be
a game-changing move.

1050
00:50:26,148 --> 00:50:29,151
If I get caught, Horseking will expect me

1051
00:50:29,235 --> 00:50:30,486
to play the Joker.

1052
00:50:30,569 --> 00:50:32,196
-Yes.
-But I have to play the 1.

1053
00:50:32,863 --> 00:50:34,031
[Pani Bottle] He ends up
with the King and a 1.

1054
00:50:34,114 --> 00:50:35,115
-Right.
-Yes.

1055
00:50:35,199 --> 00:50:38,744
If he has the King and a 1,
she will have a decent shot against him.

1056
00:50:39,411 --> 00:50:41,330
[Pani Bottle] Now,
it's totally just a battle of wits.

1057
00:50:41,413 --> 00:50:43,582
So, it has to be King and 1.

1058
00:50:43,666 --> 00:50:44,667
I'll try to catch him.

1059
00:50:44,750 --> 00:50:45,751
PLAN TO LOWER
HORSEKING'S REGULAR CARD TO A 1

1060
00:50:47,086 --> 00:50:50,714
Once I got a 1,
it felt like I had nothing to lose.

1061
00:50:50,798 --> 00:50:53,384
Our remaining numbers were really low.

1062
00:50:53,467 --> 00:50:56,178
But one thing gave us hope.

1063
00:50:56,262 --> 00:50:59,265
They didn't know who our Joker was.

1064
00:50:59,348 --> 00:51:02,476
So we figured
we should just attack the King.

1065
00:51:03,852 --> 00:51:06,605
[Horseking] They'll probably do everything
they can to keep Joker hidden.

1066
00:51:06,689 --> 00:51:09,149
Whether it's Pani Bottle or Jimin,
they'll keep it hidden.

1067
00:51:09,233 --> 00:51:12,570
Their focus should be hiding
the identity of the Joker.

1068
00:51:12,653 --> 00:51:15,864
We still don't know who the Joker is.

1069
00:51:15,948 --> 00:51:17,992
We don't know what's going to happen.

1070
00:51:18,075 --> 00:51:20,202
Once we identify the Joker,
they're done for.

1071
00:51:20,286 --> 00:51:22,246
[ZZONE] How are we going
to get rid of Ddolddol's 3?

1072
00:51:22,329 --> 00:51:24,123
-[Jaegyun] We'll find three more symbols.
-[ZZONE] Okay.

1073
00:51:24,206 --> 00:51:25,958
Once Ddolddol's 3 disappears,

1074
00:51:26,041 --> 00:51:28,377
-they're left with one King.
-Yes. Ddolddol's card will be gone.

1075
00:51:28,460 --> 00:51:31,046
The highest card they had was only a 3.

1076
00:51:31,130 --> 00:51:33,132
I had a 5.

1077
00:51:33,215 --> 00:51:35,843
As long as Junseo
doesn't tag me with his 1

1078
00:51:36,343 --> 00:51:38,596
and I tag Jimin or Pani Bottle,

1079
00:51:38,679 --> 00:51:40,514
the game is over.

1080
00:51:41,307 --> 00:51:42,850
[alarm blaring]

1081
00:51:42,933 --> 00:51:44,977
We just need to corner them.
We're on the offensive.

1082
00:51:45,060 --> 00:51:47,104
[Jaegyun] If we go at them, they'll panic.

1083
00:51:49,148 --> 00:51:50,899
I'll go right. You two go left.

1084
00:51:51,567 --> 00:51:52,568
Horseking, let me know

1085
00:51:52,651 --> 00:51:54,403
-if four of them come.
-[Horseking] Sure.

1086
00:51:57,156 --> 00:51:59,158
[Pani Bottle] Let's just check
where Horseking is.

1087
00:52:00,409 --> 00:52:01,910
RED TEAM'S TARGET IS HORSEKING

1088
00:52:01,994 --> 00:52:04,580
[Ddolddol] I don't think they will try
to sneak in anymore.

1089
00:52:05,331 --> 00:52:06,332
[Pani Bottle] Let me know
if you see anyone.

1090
00:52:06,415 --> 00:52:07,416
[Ddolddol] He's coming.

1091
00:52:07,499 --> 00:52:08,542
-[Pani Bottle] Is someone there?
-Yes.

1092
00:52:08,626 --> 00:52:10,127
[Pani Bottle] Then, I'll go around.

1093
00:52:10,210 --> 00:52:11,837
-I'll go around.
-[Junseo] Yes, go ahead.

1094
00:52:12,963 --> 00:52:17,801
BLUE TEAM MEMBERS ENTER
FROM DIFFERENT DIRECTIONS

1095
00:52:18,385 --> 00:52:20,763
-[Jimin] Is that Horseking up ahead?
-[Junseo] Yes.

1096
00:52:21,555 --> 00:52:22,723
-[Jimin] He's alone.
-[Junseo] Right.

1097
00:52:22,806 --> 00:52:24,558
[Jimin] How about the three of us
charge him?

1098
00:52:24,642 --> 00:52:26,727
-[Junseo] Sure, I'll tag him.
-[Jimin] I won't tag him.

1099
00:52:26,810 --> 00:52:28,854
There are three here! Kim Ddolddol.

1100
00:52:29,563 --> 00:52:31,106
-Junseo!
-[Jaegyun] What?

1101
00:52:31,190 --> 00:52:32,900
[Horseking] Pani Bottle is hiding!

1102
00:52:36,111 --> 00:52:37,446
No one's here.

1103
00:52:44,078 --> 00:52:49,541
PANI BOTTLE SPOTTED JAEGYUN AND JOONSU

1104
00:52:52,419 --> 00:52:53,420
[Pani Bottle] Jaegyun's on this side.

1105
00:52:53,504 --> 00:52:54,963
-There are four here!
-Jaegyun's on that side.

1106
00:52:55,047 --> 00:52:56,423
Jaegyun's over there.

1107
00:52:57,007 --> 00:52:58,008
[Horseking] Four!

1108
00:52:58,842 --> 00:52:59,843
Four people are coming!

1109
00:52:59,927 --> 00:53:01,011
HORSEKING IS OUTNUMBERED 4 TO 1

1110
00:53:01,095 --> 00:53:03,013
Come this way! We can surround them!

1111
00:53:03,097 --> 00:53:04,682
-[Jaegyun] What?
-[Joonsu] I can't hear him.

1112
00:53:05,432 --> 00:53:07,101
[Jaegyun] Horseking, what did you say?

1113
00:53:08,769 --> 00:53:11,563
JAEGYUN AND JOONSU ARE PANICKING

1114
00:53:12,147 --> 00:53:13,857
[Pani Bottle] Cover my back.

1115
00:53:13,941 --> 00:53:15,234
RED TEAM HUNTS HORSEKING

1116
00:53:15,317 --> 00:53:16,694
[Horseking] Coming our way!

1117
00:53:17,820 --> 00:53:21,240
The plan was to avoid getting caught
by Junseo and have our team members

1118
00:53:21,323 --> 00:53:22,491
surround and tag them.

1119
00:53:22,574 --> 00:53:23,784
[sighs]

1120
00:53:23,867 --> 00:53:25,411
But it didn't go as planned.

1121
00:53:28,622 --> 00:53:30,124
[Junseo] You can come with us.
Stick with us.

1122
00:53:30,207 --> 00:53:31,208
[Pani Bottle] Okay.

1123
00:53:31,792 --> 00:53:33,210
No one's here.

1124
00:53:33,293 --> 00:53:38,173
JAEGYUN AND JOONSU
ARE UNAWARE OF HORSEKING'S SITUATION

1125
00:53:39,091 --> 00:53:42,678
HORSEKING IS COMPLETELY CORNERED

1126
00:53:42,761 --> 00:53:43,929
Let's give it a shot.

1127
00:53:45,180 --> 00:53:46,432
YUK JUNSEO CHARGES IN

1128
00:53:46,974 --> 00:53:47,975
HORSEKING PANICS

1129
00:53:48,058 --> 00:53:49,852
[♪ tense music playing]

1130
00:54:03,115 --> 00:54:04,116
JUNSEO TAGS HORSEKING

1131
00:54:04,199 --> 00:54:05,409
-[Junseo] Okay.
-[alarm blaring]

1132
00:54:05,492 --> 00:54:06,493
[Horseking] Okay, okay.

1133
00:54:06,577 --> 00:54:08,245
[host] Tag confirmed.

1134
00:54:08,328 --> 00:54:09,455
So fast.

1135
00:54:09,538 --> 00:54:11,039
[Jimin] Junseo's still got it.

1136
00:54:13,917 --> 00:54:18,088
Ah, I may have exposed
my play style too much.

1137
00:54:18,172 --> 00:54:22,968
My plan to escape
using parkour didn't work.

1138
00:54:24,595 --> 00:54:28,098
[dealer] Horseking, Yuk Junseo,
please submit your cards.

1139
00:54:28,182 --> 00:54:30,100
[♪ intriguing music playing]

1140
00:54:30,184 --> 00:54:33,312
[Junseo] I had to get
inside the King's head.

1141
00:54:33,395 --> 00:54:35,564
They'd basically had the game in the bag,

1142
00:54:35,647 --> 00:54:39,026
but there was a small chance
it could all suddenly slip away.

1143
00:54:39,777 --> 00:54:42,279
[Horseking] We haven't figured out
who's holding the Joker yet.

1144
00:54:42,362 --> 00:54:46,492
If Junseo has the Joker
and decides to play the Joker

1145
00:54:46,575 --> 00:54:50,370
instead of a number card,
I could be the one who loses.

1146
00:54:51,663 --> 00:54:52,873
This is Horseking's.

1147
00:54:54,875 --> 00:54:56,251
[dealer] We will check the cards.

1148
00:54:56,335 --> 00:54:57,503
YUK JUNSEO, HORSEKING

1149
00:54:58,212 --> 00:54:59,922
Horseking has won.

1150
00:55:01,423 --> 00:55:04,218
[Horseking] Unfortunately, I had no choice
but to play the 5.

1151
00:55:04,718 --> 00:55:10,390
I made the best choice I could at the time
and I think it paid off.

1152
00:55:11,308 --> 00:55:14,186
[host] Yuk Junseo is eliminated.

1153
00:55:14,269 --> 00:55:16,355
JANG EUNSIL, YUK JUNSEO, YANG DAIL
ELIMINATED

1154
00:55:17,523 --> 00:55:21,276
[ZZONE groans] This is insane.
It wasn't Eunsil or Junseo?

1155
00:55:21,985 --> 00:55:25,906
THE JOKER SUSPECTS ARE DOWN TO TWO

1156
00:55:26,990 --> 00:55:27,991
What a shame.

1157
00:55:28,951 --> 00:55:31,119
Maybe I should've battled them.

1158
00:55:31,203 --> 00:55:33,747
-[Joonsu] But four-on-one was too much.
-[Jaegyun] Yeah.

1159
00:55:33,830 --> 00:55:35,082
KING UNFORTUNATELY LOST A HIGH NUMBER

1160
00:55:35,165 --> 00:55:36,333
[Horseking] I'm sorry.

1161
00:55:36,416 --> 00:55:38,335
[inhales] I made a mistake.

1162
00:55:38,418 --> 00:55:40,420
-We gave them hope at the last minute.
-Yes.

1163
00:55:41,004 --> 00:55:42,256
[sighs]

1164
00:55:42,339 --> 00:55:45,842
[Horseking] Yes, it was my arrogance
and a huge mistake on my part.

1165
00:55:45,926 --> 00:55:50,847
I basically took away
all the possible ways we could win

1166
00:55:50,931 --> 00:55:54,184
and gave the opposing team
a few possible ways to win.

1167
00:55:55,435 --> 00:55:57,771
-It was a bit of a shame at the end.
-[Horseking] I know.

1168
00:55:57,854 --> 00:55:59,523
HORSEKING CAN'T EASILY DEFEND HIS KING

1169
00:56:00,691 --> 00:56:03,735
[Jimin] Horseking must've played
a regular card, right?

1170
00:56:04,278 --> 00:56:05,946
Playing the King would be too risky.

1171
00:56:06,029 --> 00:56:10,367
He must've thought there was no way
I'd only given Junseo regular cards,

1172
00:56:10,450 --> 00:56:13,203
so I think Horseking played
a regular number card.

1173
00:56:13,287 --> 00:56:16,540
Horseking must've taken the 1 card.

1174
00:56:16,623 --> 00:56:18,500
Could they think I'm the Joker?

1175
00:56:19,001 --> 00:56:20,460
-Is that possible?
-It is.

1176
00:56:20,544 --> 00:56:23,714
Let's say Horseking comes to tag us.
If he plays a 1, and I play a 3,

1177
00:56:23,797 --> 00:56:27,843
and I'm lucky enough to take the 1,
then he'd only have the King.

1178
00:56:27,926 --> 00:56:30,679
Horseking has no idea
which one of us is the Joker.

1179
00:56:30,762 --> 00:56:33,932
If either Jimin or I get tagged,

1180
00:56:34,016 --> 00:56:36,310
Horseking will definitely play a 1.

1181
00:56:36,393 --> 00:56:40,188
Then, we could play our number cards
to get rid of his number card.

1182
00:56:40,272 --> 00:56:42,733
He'd be left with only the King,
giving us a clear advantage.

1183
00:56:42,816 --> 00:56:45,444
So we decided to go all-in
on tagging Horseking.

1184
00:56:46,111 --> 00:56:48,155
[groans] Those punks are all coming.

1185
00:56:48,238 --> 00:56:49,573
No, there are two.

1186
00:56:50,574 --> 00:56:54,161
We'll be at a disadvantage fighting here,
so we'll slowly draw them out.

1187
00:56:54,244 --> 00:56:55,245
Let's stall here, okay?

1188
00:56:55,329 --> 00:56:57,247
-Let's circle around in the open area.
-[Joonsu] Okay.

1189
00:56:57,331 --> 00:56:58,957
HORSEKING AND JOONSU FROM THE BLUE TEAM

1190
00:56:59,041 --> 00:57:00,626
[Horseking]
We'll definitely see an opening,

1191
00:57:00,709 --> 00:57:02,210
whether it's Jimin or someone else.

1192
00:57:02,294 --> 00:57:03,670
Let's stall here.

1193
00:57:10,761 --> 00:57:11,928
Go around that way.

1194
00:57:15,724 --> 00:57:18,185
KIM DDOLDDOL'S IRONCLAD DEFENSE

1195
00:57:19,144 --> 00:57:21,688
Hey, get in there
and hit them from the back.

1196
00:57:22,689 --> 00:57:24,358
[Pani Bottle] Horseking was our target,

1197
00:57:24,441 --> 00:57:26,318
but he kept coming out to face us.

1198
00:57:26,401 --> 00:57:29,404
The opportunity was definitely there,

1199
00:57:29,488 --> 00:57:31,907
but it was hard to find the right moment.

1200
00:57:34,326 --> 00:57:35,494
[Ddolddol] Then I will...

1201
00:57:35,577 --> 00:57:37,579
Hey, Joonsu's behind you.

1202
00:57:38,163 --> 00:57:39,164
[Pani Bottle] I'll stay here.

1203
00:57:39,706 --> 00:57:40,707
[Jimin] No, no.

1204
00:57:41,333 --> 00:57:42,501
[♪ ominous music plays]

1205
00:57:42,584 --> 00:57:43,585
[Jimin grunts]

1206
00:57:45,796 --> 00:57:46,797
[grunts softly]

1207
00:57:47,381 --> 00:57:48,674
[Jimin grunting]

1208
00:57:48,757 --> 00:57:51,134
JOKER PARK JIMIN AMBUSHES HORSEKING

1209
00:57:51,218 --> 00:57:52,636
FAILS TO TAG

1210
00:57:52,719 --> 00:57:54,012
[Horseking grunts]

1211
00:57:55,597 --> 00:57:57,265
[Horseking] Okay, got him. Nice!

1212
00:57:57,849 --> 00:57:58,850
Let's play.

1213
00:57:58,934 --> 00:58:00,477
HORSEKING TAGS PANI BOTTLE

1214
00:58:00,560 --> 00:58:03,146
-[alarm blaring]
-[host] Tag confirmed.

1215
00:58:04,064 --> 00:58:06,400
Why did he come at me? Why did he tag me?

1216
00:58:06,483 --> 00:58:09,945
The strategy did work,
but on the other hand,

1217
00:58:10,028 --> 00:58:14,616
since he knew I wasn't the Joker,
he might play the King or the 5,

1218
00:58:14,700 --> 00:58:16,910
which could make it tough for us to win.

1219
00:58:19,663 --> 00:58:22,290
[dealer] Pani Bottle has submitted a card.

1220
00:58:27,129 --> 00:58:30,674
Here is the result, Pani Bottle has won.

1221
00:58:31,717 --> 00:58:32,843
[Horseking] Let's go.

1222
00:58:33,343 --> 00:58:36,638
I was so surprised. "Really? I won?"

1223
00:58:38,432 --> 00:58:40,434
[Horseking sighs] For crying out loud.

1224
00:58:40,517 --> 00:58:43,186
Horseking was convinced I was the Joker.

1225
00:58:43,270 --> 00:58:45,564
He was sure I was the Joker,

1226
00:58:45,647 --> 00:58:48,233
so he played the 1
to try to take the Joker.

1227
00:58:48,316 --> 00:58:49,401
That was immense.

1228
00:58:49,484 --> 00:58:51,069
That was a huge miscalculation.

1229
00:58:53,029 --> 00:58:55,657
[Pani Bottle] What matters most
is that I'm still in the game,

1230
00:58:55,741 --> 00:58:57,909
and the King
has no other number cards left.

1231
00:58:57,993 --> 00:59:00,287
If he's up against the Joker, he's dead.

1232
00:59:00,996 --> 00:59:03,623
Now, he has only the King card.

1233
00:59:03,707 --> 00:59:05,000
-What?
-[Pani Bottle] He played the 1.

1234
00:59:05,083 --> 00:59:06,793
-[Ddolddol] Really?
-Yeah, no elimination announcement.

1235
00:59:06,877 --> 00:59:09,129
-No way.
-He only has one King left.

1236
00:59:09,212 --> 00:59:11,298
He played the 1, thinking I had the Joker.

1237
00:59:12,841 --> 00:59:15,218
-Can they not confirm it?
-I can't believe this.

1238
00:59:15,302 --> 00:59:17,554
[Ddolddol] Pani Bottle did an amazing job.

1239
00:59:17,637 --> 00:59:20,766
I'm not sure if Pani Bottle did well
or if Horseking did poorly.

1240
00:59:20,849 --> 00:59:23,977
He took the 1 with just a 3. [laughs]

1241
00:59:24,060 --> 00:59:25,437
We survived one more time.

1242
00:59:25,520 --> 00:59:26,897
That works in our favor

1243
00:59:26,980 --> 00:59:29,775
because Pani Bottle
could still pretend to be the Joker,

1244
00:59:29,858 --> 00:59:32,277
while Jimin was the real Joker
and I was the King.

1245
00:59:32,360 --> 00:59:34,237
So, for the other team,

1246
00:59:34,321 --> 00:59:38,241
it was difficult to be sure
about picking someone to attack,

1247
00:59:38,325 --> 00:59:39,367
except for Horseking.

1248
00:59:39,451 --> 00:59:42,120
But now he's down to just the King.

1249
00:59:42,204 --> 00:59:45,373
Oh my gosh, look at this.
The King has been crippled. [chuckles]

1250
00:59:45,457 --> 00:59:47,250
He's been stripped of his crown.

1251
00:59:47,876 --> 00:59:49,169
[Jaegyun] How did it go?

1252
00:59:50,670 --> 00:59:53,215
I'm sorry, it's because I threw away
my 5 on Junseo.

1253
00:59:53,298 --> 00:59:55,175
If only I played better
and took one card away,

1254
00:59:55,258 --> 00:59:56,968
I could've taken another card.

1255
00:59:57,052 --> 00:59:58,261
[sighs]

1256
00:59:58,345 --> 01:00:01,431
Having just the King is really risky.

1257
01:00:01,515 --> 01:00:04,601
The one thing that went wrong
with our strategy

1258
01:00:05,101 --> 01:00:06,561
was because of my mistake,

1259
01:00:06,645 --> 01:00:08,313
so it really hurt knowing that.

1260
01:00:08,855 --> 01:00:11,024
He desperately protected Jimin.

1261
01:00:11,107 --> 01:00:12,108
I know.

1262
01:00:13,777 --> 01:00:15,570
-Is it Jimin?
-Is Jimin the Joker?

1263
01:00:15,654 --> 01:00:17,864
[Horseking] Right?
That's what I'm really suspicious of.

1264
01:00:17,948 --> 01:00:20,075
We actually got into a scuffle,

1265
01:00:20,158 --> 01:00:22,953
and Pani Bottle
wouldn't stop protecting her.

1266
01:00:25,247 --> 01:00:26,456
What do we do then?

1267
01:00:27,457 --> 01:00:28,458
[Jaegyun] What?

1268
01:00:28,542 --> 01:00:30,669
BLUE TEAM STILL HAS NO CLUE
WHO THE JOKER IS

1269
01:00:30,752 --> 01:00:34,422
All they have is the King.
He'll be hard for you to tag, but still...

1270
01:00:35,048 --> 01:00:36,842
Shit, if I get him, it's really over.

1271
01:00:37,342 --> 01:00:38,969
They'll keep running like hell.

1272
01:00:39,803 --> 01:00:40,804
The best-case scenario

1273
01:00:40,887 --> 01:00:42,514
-would be what played out just now.
-[Jimin] Right.

1274
01:00:42,597 --> 01:00:45,517
-If we get another situation like that...
-[Ddolddol] Yeah.

1275
01:00:45,600 --> 01:00:46,726
...I can get him.

1276
01:00:46,810 --> 01:00:49,688
Pani Bottle has to buy me
a bit more time without getting caught.

1277
01:00:49,771 --> 01:00:51,565
In that situation, can I let him get me?

1278
01:00:51,648 --> 01:00:54,609
Wait for Horseking to let his guard down
and then tag him.

1279
01:00:54,693 --> 01:00:57,279
-Yeah, make yourself an easy target.
-Okay.

1280
01:00:57,362 --> 01:01:00,574
We really have no idea
what's going to happen.

1281
01:01:01,408 --> 01:01:07,038
Let's just go for it like moths to a flame
and see what happens.

1282
01:01:07,122 --> 01:01:08,415
[♪ thrilling music playing]

1283
01:01:08,498 --> 01:01:10,041
[Ddolddol] Two are coming.
It's the same two.

1284
01:01:10,125 --> 01:01:11,835
-[Pani Bottle] The same? Okay.
-Just like before.

1285
01:01:11,918 --> 01:01:13,545
-[Pani Bottle] I'll throw myself at him.
-Okay.

1286
01:01:16,006 --> 01:01:18,800
[Pani Bottle] It's like a final showdown.
[sighs heavily]

1287
01:01:19,301 --> 01:01:22,262
Enemies always end up crossing paths.

1288
01:01:22,345 --> 01:01:24,389
[Horseking] It's all or nothing now.

1289
01:01:27,809 --> 01:01:29,811
[♪ thrilling music continues playing]

1290
01:01:30,478 --> 01:01:33,315
This is crazy.
How did we get to this point?

1291
01:01:34,691 --> 01:01:37,068
We were so close to winning
a little while ago.

1292
01:01:38,153 --> 01:01:39,446
[Pani Bottle] Shield, move forward.

1293
01:01:40,864 --> 01:01:42,073
Shield, move to the front.

1294
01:01:42,824 --> 01:01:43,825
-Come here.
-[Ddolddol] Should we go

1295
01:01:43,909 --> 01:01:45,327
-all the way to their side?
-[Pani Bottle] Yes.

1296
01:01:45,410 --> 01:01:46,578
Let's see how long you can run from us.

1297
01:01:46,661 --> 01:01:48,288
-[Horseking] Come and get me.
-Walk, walk.

1298
01:01:48,371 --> 01:01:49,372
[Ddolddol exclaims]

1299
01:01:49,456 --> 01:01:50,707
RED TEAM CONFIDENTLY MARCHES FORWARD

1300
01:01:50,790 --> 01:01:53,043
[Pani Bottle] We thought
we had a pretty big advantage,

1301
01:01:53,126 --> 01:01:54,628
so we started to be more aggressive.

1302
01:01:54,711 --> 01:01:56,504
There are too many of you.

1303
01:01:57,631 --> 01:02:00,759
[Pani Bottle] This won't do.
Let's take out the Pink Princess.

1304
01:02:02,093 --> 01:02:03,303
-[Jimin] Pink Princess?
-[Pani Bottle] Yes.

1305
01:02:03,386 --> 01:02:04,387
-[Ddolddol] The Princess.
-Yeah.

1306
01:02:04,471 --> 01:02:06,723
-It'll be over soon.
-[Jimin] There's the Pink Princess.

1307
01:02:08,058 --> 01:02:09,142
Where's the Pink Princess?

1308
01:02:09,225 --> 01:02:10,518
There she is.

1309
01:02:10,602 --> 01:02:12,395
[ZZONE panting]

1310
01:02:16,149 --> 01:02:17,275
What is she doing?

1311
01:02:22,322 --> 01:02:25,200
ZZONE & JAEGYUN
COME WITH RED TEAM'S SYMBOLS

1312
01:02:25,283 --> 01:02:26,576
[groans]

1313
01:02:27,243 --> 01:02:28,244
[Horseking] Hey!

1314
01:02:29,079 --> 01:02:32,874
JOONSU BLOCKS THE WAY

1315
01:02:40,966 --> 01:02:43,635
It's okay, get up. Okay, play defense.

1316
01:02:45,303 --> 01:02:46,888
[ZZONE] It was so scary.

1317
01:02:49,099 --> 01:02:50,767
[Horseking] Play defense!

1318
01:02:54,062 --> 01:02:55,563
It's okay. Play defense. Go all the way.

1319
01:02:58,066 --> 01:02:59,317
They're all here! Hurry!

1320
01:03:00,694 --> 01:03:03,863
[Jaegyun] Get in there now, ZZONE.
They're in a standoff. Go!

1321
01:03:07,492 --> 01:03:09,869
-[clatters]
-[alarm blaring]

1322
01:03:14,416 --> 01:03:17,377
[host] Ten Red Team symbols

1323
01:03:19,713 --> 01:03:20,922
have been retrieved.

1324
01:03:21,548 --> 01:03:22,549
[Jaegyun] That's 10.

1325
01:03:23,049 --> 01:03:27,637
HIGH-CARD ELIMINATION TICKET EARNED

1326
01:03:27,721 --> 01:03:31,558
Everything was going exactly to our plan.

1327
01:03:31,641 --> 01:03:32,642
[Jaegyun] How did it go?

1328
01:03:32,726 --> 01:03:33,727
HORSEKING TAGS PANI BOTTLE

1329
01:03:34,269 --> 01:03:36,980
I'm sorry, it's because I threw away
my 5 on Junseo.

1330
01:03:37,063 --> 01:03:38,940
Then, you two

1331
01:03:39,024 --> 01:03:41,693
-stall instead of taking them on.
-Okay.

1332
01:03:42,694 --> 01:03:43,778
They have only three left.

1333
01:03:43,862 --> 01:03:45,864
-All three of them will come out.
-Yes.

1334
01:03:45,947 --> 01:03:49,159
I'll go around, head upstairs,
and grab a symbol.

1335
01:03:49,242 --> 01:03:50,744
-There are four upstairs.
-[Horseking] Okay.

1336
01:03:50,827 --> 01:03:52,370
JAEGYUN & ZZONE SECRETLY FOUND SYMBOLS

1337
01:03:52,454 --> 01:03:55,623
We could've easily lost our advantage,

1338
01:03:55,707 --> 01:03:57,417
so we decided to delay the tag.

1339
01:03:57,500 --> 01:03:59,878
If we find all 10,
their 3 card would disappear,

1340
01:03:59,961 --> 01:04:01,588
leaving only the King.

1341
01:04:01,671 --> 01:04:03,631
We changed our plan

1342
01:04:03,715 --> 01:04:07,052
and looked for the symbols first
while Horseking kept them busy.

1343
01:04:07,719 --> 01:04:08,720
-Come here.
-[Ddolddol] Should we go

1344
01:04:08,803 --> 01:04:10,180
-all the way to their side?
-[Pani Bottle] Yes.

1345
01:04:10,263 --> 01:04:11,431
Let's see how long you can run from us.

1346
01:04:11,514 --> 01:04:14,142
ENTERING RED TEAM BASE

1347
01:04:18,104 --> 01:04:20,106
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1348
01:04:32,035 --> 01:04:35,413
We were dead set on winning,

1349
01:04:35,497 --> 01:04:37,248
no matter what it took.

1350
01:04:37,332 --> 01:04:41,294
We kept at it and collected all 10.
They found one, and we collected all 10.

1351
01:04:41,377 --> 01:04:44,089
Now, they only have the King.
They have nowhere to run.

1352
01:04:44,172 --> 01:04:49,677
[host] Red Team's highest number card,
Kim Ddolddol's 3 card, is out.

1353
01:04:49,761 --> 01:04:51,221
DDOLDDOL: KING
PANI BOTTLE: 1, JIMIN: 2, JOKER

1354
01:04:53,389 --> 01:04:54,390
[Pani Bottle exclaims]

1355
01:04:55,058 --> 01:04:59,312
We were thinking we could win
and just needed to get Horseking.

1356
01:04:59,395 --> 01:05:02,899
Then suddenly, the siren went off
and our 3 was gone.

1357
01:05:03,691 --> 01:05:08,029
They found all 10 symbols,
so I've been stripped of my crown too.

1358
01:05:08,113 --> 01:05:10,782
Both Kings are down
to just their own cards.

1359
01:05:10,865 --> 01:05:13,493
If I run into the Joker,
I'm completely screwed.

1360
01:05:14,119 --> 01:05:15,995
Something's seriously gone wrong.

1361
01:05:16,079 --> 01:05:17,997
-Did they find them all?
-[Ddolddol] Yes, 10.

1362
01:05:18,081 --> 01:05:19,749
So now it's a matter
of who tags who first?

1363
01:05:19,833 --> 01:05:21,167
WHO WILL BEAT THE OTHER KING FIRST?

1364
01:05:22,127 --> 01:05:23,545
-[Horseking] We're almost there.
-Almost there.

1365
01:05:23,628 --> 01:05:26,172
-[Horseking] The four of us can do this.
-[Jaegyun] Good job stalling.

1366
01:05:26,756 --> 01:05:29,717
From now on, they're going to...

1367
01:05:29,801 --> 01:05:31,386
-[Jaegyun] They'll protect him.
-...protect Ddolddol.

1368
01:05:31,469 --> 01:05:32,595
-Right.
-We could let the Joker

1369
01:05:32,679 --> 01:05:34,556
walk around out in the open.

1370
01:05:34,639 --> 01:05:36,516
We can surround him,

1371
01:05:36,599 --> 01:05:38,935
lure him in, and tag him,
but here's the thing.

1372
01:05:40,228 --> 01:05:42,772
I'm in a situation where I have to run.

1373
01:05:42,856 --> 01:05:44,023
-[Jaegyun] Right.
-Because of the Joker.

1374
01:05:44,107 --> 01:05:46,025
So you have to keep an eye on Jimin.

1375
01:05:46,109 --> 01:05:47,110
-[Jaegyun] Yeah.
-Right.

1376
01:05:47,694 --> 01:05:49,154
I think Jimin is the Joker.

1377
01:05:49,737 --> 01:05:51,489
[Jimin] Should I take on Horseking?

1378
01:05:51,573 --> 01:05:53,366
I don't think I can tag Horseking easily.

1379
01:05:53,449 --> 01:05:55,785
As long as we get one of them, we're good.

1380
01:05:55,869 --> 01:05:57,787
-Among Joonsu, ZZONE, and Jaegyun.
-Yes.

1381
01:05:57,871 --> 01:05:59,539
[Pani Bottle]
Instead of chasing Horseking,

1382
01:05:59,622 --> 01:06:01,207
we should find ZZONE and tag her.

1383
01:06:01,291 --> 01:06:02,834
Our plan for the second half was simple.

1384
01:06:02,917 --> 01:06:05,628
From here on out,
just go all in and tag them.

1385
01:06:05,712 --> 01:06:08,965
Like a moth to a flame.
Each of us had a role.

1386
01:06:09,048 --> 01:06:12,635
My role was to tag someone
with a regular number and eliminate them.

1387
01:06:12,719 --> 01:06:15,847
Jimin's job was to somehow tag Horseking.

1388
01:06:15,930 --> 01:06:18,224
Pani Bottle's role
was to take away the Joker.

1389
01:06:18,308 --> 01:06:19,309
That was our plan.

1390
01:06:19,392 --> 01:06:21,019
-I'll run the moment I see them.
-[Jimin] Let's go.

1391
01:06:21,102 --> 01:06:23,438
[Ddolddol] I'll do my best
to tag ZZONE, no matter what.

1392
01:06:23,521 --> 01:06:24,522
[Jimin] Okay.

1393
01:06:24,606 --> 01:06:27,942
-[ZZONE sighs] This is crazy.
-Just one more time.

1394
01:06:28,026 --> 01:06:29,694
We're almost there. [exhales]

1395
01:06:29,777 --> 01:06:32,155
-[sighs]
-We're really grinding them down.

1396
01:06:32,238 --> 01:06:34,407
-[ZZONE] Yes, we're wearing them down.
-[Jaegyun] Exactly.

1397
01:06:34,490 --> 01:06:36,910
We've pulled those who were hiding out.

1398
01:06:37,410 --> 01:06:38,411
[alarm blaring]

1399
01:06:38,494 --> 01:06:39,871
-Let's go slow.
-[Horseking] Go slow.

1400
01:06:39,954 --> 01:06:41,539
-[Joonsu] Okay.
-[ZZONE] Let's keep up the momentum.

1401
01:06:41,623 --> 01:06:44,042
[host] The Battle Round has begun.

1402
01:06:45,460 --> 01:06:48,546
We've got them cornered now.
But one wrong tag, and it's over.

1403
01:06:48,630 --> 01:06:51,883
-I know, we're so close.
-Yeah, we have them backed into a corner.

1404
01:06:54,010 --> 01:06:55,929
We're like moths to a flame right now.

1405
01:06:56,012 --> 01:06:57,931
-I know.
-[laughing]

1406
01:06:58,014 --> 01:07:00,600
[Ddolddol] It's all about momentum.
Don't get scared.

1407
01:07:00,683 --> 01:07:02,894
-All four of them are here.
-[Jimin] They're all here.

1408
01:07:02,977 --> 01:07:04,812
[sighs] Seriously...

1409
01:07:04,896 --> 01:07:06,397
[Horseking] Everyone
knows their target, right?

1410
01:07:06,481 --> 01:07:07,482
-[ZZONE] Yes.
-[Jaegyun] Jimin.

1411
01:07:07,565 --> 01:07:09,484
[Horseking] I need to avoid Jimin.

1412
01:07:11,152 --> 01:07:12,362
[Jimin] Let's go.

1413
01:07:13,696 --> 01:07:15,698
[♪ epic music playing]

1414
01:07:24,082 --> 01:07:25,291
[ZZONE] Come over here.

1415
01:07:30,964 --> 01:07:35,593
RED TEAM'S SURPRISE MOTH-TO-FLAME ATTACK

1416
01:07:40,139 --> 01:07:41,140
[Pani Bottle grunts]

1417
01:07:41,224 --> 01:07:44,102
JOONSU TAGS PANI BOTTLE

1418
01:07:45,520 --> 01:07:46,688
[Ddolddol] Tag, tag!

1419
01:07:46,771 --> 01:07:47,939
KIM DDOLDDOL TAGS ZZONE

1420
01:07:48,022 --> 01:07:49,023
Tag.

1421
01:07:49,899 --> 01:07:50,900
-[Jimin] Tag!
-What?

1422
01:07:50,984 --> 01:07:51,985
JIMIN TAGS HORSEKING

1423
01:07:52,068 --> 01:07:53,236
Hey!

1424
01:07:53,319 --> 01:07:55,280
-[alarm blaring]
-[host] Tag confirmed.

1425
01:07:57,282 --> 01:07:58,408
[knocks on door]

1426
01:07:59,325 --> 01:08:00,702
Hello.

1427
01:08:02,996 --> 01:08:04,956
[Ddolddol] Tag, tag!

1428
01:08:05,039 --> 01:08:06,291
-[Jimin] Tag!
-[player] Tag.

1429
01:08:06,374 --> 01:08:07,500
[host] Tag confirmed.

1430
01:08:07,583 --> 01:08:08,751
DDOLDDOL LANDED FIRST TAG

1431
01:08:09,460 --> 01:08:11,838
[dealer] We will check
both players' cards.

1432
01:08:11,921 --> 01:08:13,298
Please hand in your cards.

1433
01:08:14,173 --> 01:08:16,426
The moth-to-flame strategy
worked like a charm.

1434
01:08:16,509 --> 01:08:19,637
Next round, we should do it again

1435
01:08:19,721 --> 01:08:22,974
and get Jimin to tag Horseking somehow.

1436
01:08:23,057 --> 01:08:24,684
This is Kim Ddolddol's card.

1437
01:08:25,518 --> 01:08:27,478
[ZZONE] What is happening?

1438
01:08:27,562 --> 01:08:29,814
I never thought he'd tag me.

1439
01:08:29,897 --> 01:08:32,692
[dealer] ZZONE, please submit your card.

1440
01:08:33,484 --> 01:08:34,861
[dealer] ZZONE...

1441
01:08:38,281 --> 01:08:39,741
[♪ intense music playing]

1442
01:08:39,824 --> 01:08:40,950
...has won.

1443
01:08:41,826 --> 01:08:44,037
-This concludes the game.
-[gasps, exclaims]

1444
01:08:51,085 --> 01:08:52,170
Checking symbols... Confirmed.

1445
01:08:52,253 --> 01:08:53,254
2 HOURS AGO

1446
01:08:56,716 --> 01:08:57,717
[shards clatter]

1447
01:08:58,634 --> 01:09:00,136
[Jaegyun]
Give us the Shuffle Ticket, please.

1448
01:09:00,803 --> 01:09:02,555
Let's go, ZZONE.

1449
01:09:03,097 --> 01:09:04,349
[Horseking] Okay.

1450
01:09:05,016 --> 01:09:07,226
If we give her 6 to Joonsu

1451
01:09:07,310 --> 01:09:10,313
and move around as a group of three,
wouldn't it be safer?

1452
01:09:10,396 --> 01:09:11,773
-ZZONE's card?
-[Horseking] The two of them.

1453
01:09:11,856 --> 01:09:14,275
We could trust Joonsu
or the two of us could do it.

1454
01:09:14,359 --> 01:09:16,736
But having one more person
could be better.

1455
01:09:16,819 --> 01:09:18,821
-Ah...
-[Horseking] What do you say?

1456
01:09:18,905 --> 01:09:19,947
It's a good idea.

1457
01:09:20,031 --> 01:09:21,449
I like that idea.

1458
01:09:21,532 --> 01:09:23,534
I'll run around on my own.

1459
01:09:23,618 --> 01:09:26,204
It seemed like the better way to go.

1460
01:09:26,287 --> 01:09:28,206
I immediately agreed to it.

1461
01:09:28,289 --> 01:09:33,086
Joonsu can move around
much more easily than I can.

1462
01:09:33,169 --> 01:09:34,754
So, we figured it'd be better

1463
01:09:34,837 --> 01:09:38,341
for me to hold onto the Joker
and stay safely hidden.

1464
01:09:38,424 --> 01:09:40,885
Horseking's idea was a stroke of genius.

1465
01:09:42,387 --> 01:09:44,764
We're going to use our Shuffle Ticket.

1466
01:09:45,515 --> 01:09:48,267
[dealer] If you would like
to use a Shuffle Ticket,

1467
01:09:48,351 --> 01:09:50,269
please submit your cards.

1468
01:09:50,353 --> 01:09:52,355
[♪ triumphant music playing]

1469
01:09:56,943 --> 01:09:58,528
JOKER TO ZZONE, 6 TO JOONSU
CARDS SHUFFLED

1470
01:09:58,611 --> 01:10:00,154
-[ZZONE] I'm counting on you.
-I'll do my best.

1471
01:10:00,238 --> 01:10:01,489
[ZZONE] I'll take good care of it.

1472
01:10:03,282 --> 01:10:04,283
[Ddolddol exclaims]

1473
01:10:04,367 --> 01:10:07,036
-[ZZONE] Finally, it's over!
-[Ddolddol] Were you the Joker?

1474
01:10:07,120 --> 01:10:08,955
[ZZONE] I was.

1475
01:10:09,038 --> 01:10:10,623
-[sighs]
-It's over!

1476
01:10:10,707 --> 01:10:14,502
[dealer] Blue Team has defeated
Red Team's King card.

1477
01:10:14,585 --> 01:10:15,920
This concludes the game.

1478
01:10:16,504 --> 01:10:17,755
Oh! I told you!

1479
01:10:17,839 --> 01:10:19,841
[cheering]

1480
01:10:20,800 --> 01:10:23,594
KINGMAKER
COMES TO AN END AFTER 16 HOURS

1481
01:10:24,762 --> 01:10:28,057
So the King ran straight into the Joker.

1482
01:10:28,141 --> 01:10:30,852
I really was a moth to a flame. [chuckles]

1483
01:10:30,935 --> 01:10:35,481
The moth-to-flame strategy worked,
but the result was a complete disaster.

1484
01:10:35,565 --> 01:10:37,150
[laughs]

1485
01:10:37,233 --> 01:10:38,693
[mic feedback]

1486
01:10:38,776 --> 01:10:42,864
[host] The winner of the Main Match,
"Kingmaker," is the Blue Team.

1487
01:10:42,947 --> 01:10:44,198
[all cheering]

1488
01:10:44,282 --> 01:10:45,491
We won!

1489
01:10:49,370 --> 01:10:52,081
-[Horseking] Good job. [sighs]
-[Joonsu] Good work.

1490
01:10:52,165 --> 01:10:53,332
Nice.

1491
01:10:53,416 --> 01:10:54,667
[exhales joyfully]

1492
01:10:54,751 --> 01:10:55,793
[Joonsu] This is so nice.

1493
01:10:55,877 --> 01:10:58,755
-It's finally over.
-[Horseking] This game was long.

1494
01:10:59,547 --> 01:11:01,966
I was the one who put this team together.

1495
01:11:02,049 --> 01:11:03,551
I felt a lot of pressure.

1496
01:11:03,634 --> 01:11:09,182
I thought if we lost, I'd feel so bad
about letting everyone down.

1497
01:11:09,265 --> 01:11:12,894
But once we won, all that agony vanished.

1498
01:11:12,977 --> 01:11:14,937
Finally, it's over!

1499
01:11:15,021 --> 01:11:16,230
[sighs in relief]

1500
01:11:16,314 --> 01:11:18,024
It was such a cathartic feeling.

1501
01:11:18,107 --> 01:11:19,150
[Jaegyun] We worked so hard

1502
01:11:19,233 --> 01:11:21,778
to search for and find the symbols.

1503
01:11:21,861 --> 01:11:25,698
I was happy and hadn't felt
that kind of dopamine rush in a while.

1504
01:11:25,782 --> 01:11:28,618
[Horseking] The thrill of playing
aggressively and taking the victory

1505
01:11:28,701 --> 01:11:31,162
felt like we'd won the whole thing.

1506
01:11:31,245 --> 01:11:32,747
-Good work.
-You too.

1507
01:11:32,830 --> 01:11:36,250
[Horseking] Starting
with Dail's sacrifice play,

1508
01:11:36,334 --> 01:11:38,169
he tagged Yuk Junseo twice.

1509
01:11:38,252 --> 01:11:39,253
[chuckling]

1510
01:11:39,337 --> 01:11:41,506
[Joonsu] That's not an easy thing to do.
That's so cool.

1511
01:11:42,089 --> 01:11:44,342
[Jaegyun] Where's Dail?
I want to tell him the good news.

1512
01:11:44,425 --> 01:11:45,426
Oh!

1513
01:11:45,510 --> 01:11:48,095
-General Yang!
-General Yang!

1514
01:11:48,679 --> 01:11:50,181
[Joonsu] General Yang!

1515
01:11:50,264 --> 01:11:52,975
-I promised you, didn't I?
-I promised we'd win, didn't I?

1516
01:11:53,059 --> 01:11:55,937
[Dail] Ah, this is the happiest
I've been this year. [exhales]

1517
01:11:56,020 --> 01:11:57,063
[chuckling]

1518
01:11:57,146 --> 01:11:58,815
This is the best day of 2026.

1519
01:11:59,524 --> 01:12:01,317
-[Jaegyun] Oh, my.
-[Dail] Oh, my team.

1520
01:12:01,400 --> 01:12:02,443
[exclaiming]

1521
01:12:02,527 --> 01:12:03,986
[ZZONE] Great work.

1522
01:12:04,070 --> 01:12:05,530
We really had a fun time.

1523
01:12:05,613 --> 01:12:07,281
-Such a fun time.
-You made it happen.

1524
01:12:07,365 --> 01:12:08,616
You made it happen, Dail.

1525
01:12:09,325 --> 01:12:12,411
For us, he was such a hero.

1526
01:12:13,621 --> 01:12:15,081
[Horseking laughing]

1527
01:12:15,164 --> 01:12:17,750
The sacrifice play was a success!

1528
01:12:17,834 --> 01:12:19,877
[Dail] They're in serious trouble.

1529
01:12:19,961 --> 01:12:21,003
[Joonsu] I know.

1530
01:12:21,838 --> 01:12:24,006
[Jaegyun] It's like a funeral over there.

1531
01:12:25,132 --> 01:12:27,134
-Hey, man!
-[Pani Bottle] What a shame.

1532
01:12:27,218 --> 01:12:28,219
We were close.

1533
01:12:28,302 --> 01:12:30,054
-[Horseking] Hey, Joonsu.
-[sighs heavily]

1534
01:12:30,137 --> 01:12:32,932
[sighs disappointedly] I'm so damn upset.

1535
01:12:38,437 --> 01:12:41,566
-You did everything you could.
-[groans] I'm so upset.

1536
01:12:42,775 --> 01:12:44,318
[both sighing]

1537
01:12:44,402 --> 01:12:46,237
This is so annoying. [sobs softly]

1538
01:12:46,821 --> 01:12:49,782
You did well.

1539
01:12:50,449 --> 01:12:51,701
We all did well.

1540
01:12:52,243 --> 01:12:53,244
[sniffles]

1541
01:12:53,744 --> 01:12:58,624
[groans] I feel bad
for letting Eunsil and Junseo down.

1542
01:12:58,708 --> 01:12:59,917
[sniffles]

1543
01:13:00,001 --> 01:13:02,169
[Pani Bottle]
We put up a really good fight.

1544
01:13:02,753 --> 01:13:04,338
-We lost, but we fought well.
-[sniffles]

1545
01:13:04,422 --> 01:13:05,590
Okay?

1546
01:13:06,632 --> 01:13:09,343
[Jimin sobbing] Seriously, I'm pissed off.

1547
01:13:09,886 --> 01:13:11,345
[exhales] I'm so pissed off.

1548
01:13:11,929 --> 01:13:16,392
The moment when you realize
that you can't beat someone,

1549
01:13:16,475 --> 01:13:18,936
you feel hopeless and angry.

1550
01:13:19,020 --> 01:13:21,022
[♪ pensive music playing]

1551
01:13:22,565 --> 01:13:24,108
Good work. I mean it.

1552
01:13:24,191 --> 01:13:26,068
You really did great.

1553
01:13:26,777 --> 01:13:29,030
[sniffles] We did all we could.

1554
01:13:38,289 --> 01:13:39,415
[sobbing]

1555
01:13:39,498 --> 01:13:41,375
[voice breaks] Pani Bottle...

1556
01:13:41,459 --> 01:13:42,501
This is so annoying.

1557
01:13:43,461 --> 01:13:44,587
[sobbing]

1558
01:13:50,843 --> 01:13:52,970
[exhales] Seriously...

1559
01:13:53,054 --> 01:13:55,431
We went through so much.

1560
01:13:58,851 --> 01:14:00,519
You did well. You did amazing.

1561
01:14:02,021 --> 01:14:03,856
You couldn't have done anything more.

1562
01:14:03,940 --> 01:14:04,941
[sniffles]

1563
01:14:05,942 --> 01:14:07,109
You did amazing.

1564
01:14:07,193 --> 01:14:09,028
[both sobbing softly]

1565
01:14:09,111 --> 01:14:12,156
-I feel terrible.
-No, don't.

1566
01:14:12,239 --> 01:14:14,659
[Jimin] If I hadn't been on this team...

1567
01:14:17,912 --> 01:14:20,289
[Pani Bottle]
Our team did everything we could.

1568
01:14:20,373 --> 01:14:21,999
That's why I cried.

1569
01:14:22,083 --> 01:14:23,918
I poured everything I had into this.

1570
01:14:25,044 --> 01:14:26,963
-[Joonsu grunts]
-[Jimin] I got you! Tag!

1571
01:14:27,546 --> 01:14:30,049
And I was really proud.

1572
01:14:30,132 --> 01:14:32,718
We may have lost, but we fought so hard.

1573
01:14:34,512 --> 01:14:37,765
So, it was really fun, really intense,

1574
01:14:39,100 --> 01:14:40,101
and really tough.

1575
01:14:41,394 --> 01:14:42,395
I'm tearing up again.

1576
01:14:45,481 --> 01:14:47,483
[♪ pensive music continues playing]

1577
01:14:48,734 --> 01:14:50,528
[breathes deeply]

1578
01:14:56,784 --> 01:14:58,077
[sniffles]

1579
01:14:58,160 --> 01:15:00,329
[voice breaks] Seriously... [exhales]

1580
01:15:05,042 --> 01:15:08,629
There were definitely moments
when we could've won.

1581
01:15:12,425 --> 01:15:13,426
[exhales]

1582
01:15:16,220 --> 01:15:18,222
By the way... [clears throat]

1583
01:15:20,850 --> 01:15:25,229
...this is my third reality survival show,
but I don't think I'll ever forget this.

1584
01:15:25,312 --> 01:15:28,858
We lost, but I'll never forget this.

1585
01:15:33,320 --> 01:15:36,198
Ah, I need to stop crying.
God damn it, I'm 40. What am I doing?

1586
01:15:37,742 --> 01:15:39,243
Shit, I'm tearing up.

1587
01:15:39,910 --> 01:15:40,953
[sniffles, exhales]

1588
01:15:41,704 --> 01:15:43,247
[Jimin breathes deeply]

1589
01:15:45,082 --> 01:15:47,084
[sobbing]

1590
01:15:53,382 --> 01:15:54,592
[Jimin groans]

1591
01:15:54,675 --> 01:15:55,676
[sobs]

1592
01:15:57,428 --> 01:16:01,348
[Jimin] We were both crying
like we'd fought for a cause and lost.

1593
01:16:02,433 --> 01:16:04,226
Going through that together,
we grew close.

1594
01:16:04,894 --> 01:16:06,062
Is my face bleeding?

1595
01:16:07,104 --> 01:16:08,856
You're bleeding. And here.

1596
01:16:08,939 --> 01:16:10,149
You've got a scratch.

1597
01:16:11,734 --> 01:16:15,863
[exhales] I'm so annoyed.
Aren't there any tissues?

1598
01:16:17,615 --> 01:16:18,657
Are you hurt?

1599
01:16:19,241 --> 01:16:21,827
-Where? How?
-[Jimin] He must've been scratched.

1600
01:16:22,703 --> 01:16:23,788
[Ddolddol sighs]

1601
01:16:23,871 --> 01:16:25,164
-We're all a mess.
-[Pani Bottle] Good work.

1602
01:16:25,247 --> 01:16:27,208
We really did our best until the very end.

1603
01:16:27,291 --> 01:16:30,628
-[Jimin] We really did.
-Well done. We did a good job.

1604
01:16:31,545 --> 01:16:34,090
We gave it everything we had
and did whatever it took.

1605
01:16:34,173 --> 01:16:35,758
Think about it.

1606
01:16:35,841 --> 01:16:38,302
We didn't chicken out.
We went for it and took them on.

1607
01:16:38,385 --> 01:16:42,264
At the end, we just charged in
and turned the whole thing into chaos.

1608
01:16:42,807 --> 01:16:44,683
We were proud.

1609
01:16:44,767 --> 01:16:46,685
We were all very brave to the end.

1610
01:16:46,769 --> 01:16:48,646
It was the Shuffle Ticket at the end.

1611
01:16:49,480 --> 01:16:50,731
[Pani Bottle]
Didn't think ZZONE was the Joker?

1612
01:16:50,815 --> 01:16:52,983
At that point, all I could do was think,

1613
01:16:53,067 --> 01:16:55,945
"Let's at least take someone out."

1614
01:16:57,071 --> 01:16:59,406
I wanted to yank
that pink hair at the end.

1615
01:16:59,490 --> 01:17:03,327
[Jimin] You did well. You didn't like
that she took everyone with her.

1616
01:17:03,828 --> 01:17:04,870
-I mean...
-[Jimin] From the start...

1617
01:17:04,954 --> 01:17:06,831
I knew it as soon as she picked four guys.

1618
01:17:06,914 --> 01:17:08,124
Right.

1619
01:17:08,207 --> 01:17:09,208
Good work.

1620
01:17:09,291 --> 01:17:11,669
I wanted to yank her pink hair so badly
in a leader fight.

1621
01:17:11,752 --> 01:17:12,878
[Jimin] One tag was good enough.

1622
01:17:12,962 --> 01:17:14,296
We should've battled,

1623
01:17:14,380 --> 01:17:16,715
but they kept hiding,
so we never got a chance.

1624
01:17:16,799 --> 01:17:19,093
Luck just wasn't on our side.
Let's think that way.

1625
01:17:19,176 --> 01:17:22,346
-[Jimin] And we really were neck-and-neck.
-Luck just wasn't on our side.

1626
01:17:22,429 --> 01:17:23,848
[Ddolddol] To be fair,
we did really amazing.

1627
01:17:23,931 --> 01:17:26,100
Considering our physical abilities,
we've already won.

1628
01:17:26,183 --> 01:17:28,435
[Ddolddol] Exactly, we really did amazing.

1629
01:17:29,812 --> 01:17:33,482
But once we get to the Death Match,

1630
01:17:33,566 --> 01:17:37,027
I swear, I don't think I'll resent
or hold anything against anyone.

1631
01:17:37,111 --> 01:17:40,072
No matter who wins and moves on or loses,
I'll be okay with it either way.

1632
01:17:40,656 --> 01:17:41,657
I mean it.

1633
01:17:42,950 --> 01:17:43,951
[Ddolddol] I felt the same.

1634
01:17:44,034 --> 01:17:47,538
If I get eliminated
and our Red Team members make it through,

1635
01:17:47,621 --> 01:17:49,623
I'll genuinely be happy for them.

1636
01:17:51,292 --> 01:17:53,878
If the Death Match is about politics,
should we take out Sanghyun first?

1637
01:17:54,378 --> 01:17:55,921
[cackling]

1638
01:17:59,091 --> 01:18:01,010
If it involves politics,
let's get rid of him first.

1639
01:18:01,093 --> 01:18:03,262
-Sanghyun has to go.
-[Pani Bottle] Then rock, paper, scissors.

1640
01:18:03,345 --> 01:18:07,016
If I do that,
I'll be the worst traitor ever.

1641
01:18:07,099 --> 01:18:08,434
No, you won't be.

1642
01:18:09,643 --> 01:18:12,104
-Still, I should, right?
-[Pani Bottle] Yes.

1643
01:18:12,188 --> 01:18:13,939
You've already betrayed people before.

1644
01:18:14,023 --> 01:18:16,775
-I mean, I was with the Red Team just now.
-[cackling]

1645
01:18:17,401 --> 01:18:19,570
Sanghyun isn't technically our family.

1646
01:18:20,154 --> 01:18:21,530
He's a stranger.

1647
01:18:22,323 --> 01:18:24,491
Being a prisoner
and being eliminated are different.

1648
01:18:24,575 --> 01:18:27,203
[Pani Bottle] Who cares?
I need to save myself first.

1649
01:18:27,286 --> 01:18:28,996
-[Ddolddol laughs]
-Send him off.

1650
01:18:29,079 --> 01:18:31,081
[♪ dramatic music playing]

1651
01:18:32,625 --> 01:18:35,294
Sanghyun was unfairly sent to prison

1652
01:18:35,377 --> 01:18:37,796
because I rallied everyone
to think he was the Seeker.

1653
01:18:37,880 --> 01:18:40,132
Now, we've come face-to-face
in the Death Match.

1654
01:18:42,801 --> 01:18:43,969
[Sanghyun groans]

1655
01:18:44,053 --> 01:18:46,138
I know he's been through a lot,

1656
01:18:46,222 --> 01:18:47,598
and he's done so well,

1657
01:18:47,681 --> 01:18:49,141
so he can go home to get some rest.

1658
01:18:51,352 --> 01:18:53,896
They say you always meet
your enemies in the Death Match.

1659
01:18:53,979 --> 01:18:55,981
[Sanghyun] I'm going to wipe everyone out
and win the game.

1660
01:18:56,065 --> 01:18:58,651
-[Ddolddol] This time...
-[Pani Bottle] Let's eliminate Sanghyun.

1661
01:18:58,734 --> 01:19:00,903
Even if it's dirty,
let's do what it takes.

1662
01:19:02,279 --> 01:19:04,615
[host] This Death Match
is an auction game.

1663
01:19:04,698 --> 01:19:05,866
[Jimin] An auction?

1664
01:19:05,950 --> 01:19:07,451
-One million won.
-10 million won.

1665
01:19:07,534 --> 01:19:09,078
-I bid 40 million.
-50 million.

1666
01:19:09,161 --> 01:19:10,371
I bid 70 million.

1667
01:19:10,454 --> 01:19:11,455
I bid 80 million.

1668
01:19:11,538 --> 01:19:14,041
[Sanghyun] The prison players
were starting to get on my nerves.

1669
01:19:15,084 --> 01:19:16,710
[Ddolddol] It's all about momentum.

1670
01:19:16,794 --> 01:19:19,129
[Sanghyun] What is this?
This is really bad.

1671
01:19:19,213 --> 01:19:21,757
[♪ tense music playing]

1672
01:19:21,840 --> 01:19:23,300
[Ddolddol] Goodbye, Sanghyun.

1673
01:19:23,801 --> 01:19:25,386
[mic feedback]

1674
01:19:25,469 --> 01:19:28,180
[host] The top two players
in this Main Match

1675
01:19:28,264 --> 01:19:29,765
will advance straight to the finals.

1676
01:19:29,848 --> 01:19:31,016
[gasps in awe]

1677
01:19:31,100 --> 01:19:32,893
[Dail] I'll do whatever it takes
to go to the finals.

1678
01:19:32,977 --> 01:19:34,186
[Jaegyun] I'm absolutely confident.

1679
01:19:34,270 --> 01:19:35,604
[Horseking] Come here.

1680
01:19:36,480 --> 01:19:37,564
[grunting]

1681
01:19:37,648 --> 01:19:38,732
[ZZONE] I'll be hiding.

1682
01:19:38,816 --> 01:19:40,567
[Joonsu] I've got to survive and win.

1683
01:19:40,651 --> 01:19:42,903
Where is everyone?

1684
01:19:42,987 --> 01:19:44,571
Let's take out the ones who are hiding.

1685
01:19:44,655 --> 01:19:46,448
We should, but I can't fucking find them.

1686
01:19:46,532 --> 01:19:47,992
-There you are.
-[Jaegyun exclaims]

1687
01:19:48,075 --> 01:19:49,702
-Hey.
-[Horseking] You're dead meat.

1688
01:19:50,744 --> 01:19:52,079
[Dail groans] For fuck's sake.

1689
01:19:52,663 --> 01:19:54,665
[♪ ominous music playing]

1690
01:20:14,101 --> 01:20:16,103
Translated by Youji Kim
